msgid "Recent changes"
msgstr "近期更新"

msgid ""
"Several well parallelized new methods have been implemented in Molpro. A "
"review of recent developments in Molpro can be found in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0005081>`__ 152, 144107 (2020)."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中已实现了几种并行化良好的新方法。关于 Molpro 近期发展的综述可参见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0005081>`__ 152, 144107 (2020)。"

msgid ""
"We recommend always to use the most recent version, since developments are "
"ongoing and problems reported by users are always fixed as quickly as "
"possible. In particular, before reporting bugs, please check if these still "
"occur in the latest version."
msgstr ""
"我们建议始终使用最新版本，因为开发工作持续进行，用户报告的问题总会尽快修复。特别是，在报告错误之前，请检查这些错误是否在最新版本中仍然出现。"

msgid "Fitting basis sets"
msgstr "拟合基组"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2025.4"
msgstr "MOLPRO2025.4 的新功能"

msgid "Bugfixes"
msgstr "错误修复"

msgid "New Option CCF12 in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 中的新选项 CCF12"

msgid ""
"A new option has been added to the PNO program, see `Options for F12 "
"calculations in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options-"
"for-f12-calculations>`__. With CCF12=0  F12 is not included in the PNO-LCCSD"
" step and the MP2 F12 correction is added to the PNO-LCCSD and PNO-LCCSD(T) "
"energies. This is similar to a ``focal point`` approximation, where the "
"high-level calculation is PNO-LMP2-F12 and the low-level one PNO-LCCSD(T)."
msgstr ""
"PNO 程序中新增了一个选项，请参阅 `PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 中 F12 计算的选项 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options-"
"for-f12-calculations>`__\\ 。当 CCF12=0 时，F12 不包含在 PNO-LCCSD 步骤中，MP2 F12 校正会加到"
" PNO-LCCSD 和 PNO-LCCSD(T) 能量上。这类似于一个 ``focal point`` 近似，其中高级计算是 PNO-"
"LMP2-F12，低级计算是 PNO-LCCSD(T)。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2025.3"
msgstr "MOLPRO2025.3 的新特性"

msgid "CABS single correction of the HF energy"
msgstr "HF 能量的 CABS 单激发校正"

msgid ""
"The program for the CABS singles correction has been improved and now runs "
"fine in parallel also on multiple nodes. Unless already available, the cabs "
"correction will from now on be automatically computed in the PNO-F12 "
"programs. It is stored in the orbital dump record and reused if available "
"for the given orbital basis."
msgstr ""
"CABS 单激发校正的程序已得到改进，现在也能在多节点上良好地并行运行。除非已存在，否则 cabs 校正从现在起将在 PNO-F12 "
"程序中自动计算。它存储在轨道转储记录中，如果对于给定的轨道基组可用，则会被重复使用。"

msgid ""
"In large cases the non-parallel diagonalizations needed for basis "
"orthonormalisation and block-diagonalization of the Fock matrix may take "
"more time than the Fock matrix evaluation. To reduce the diagonalization "
"time, the PNO program uses by default ORTHO_CABS=0. This saves one large "
"diagonalization, but has only a negligible effect on relative energies. This"
" default can be overwritten in the PNO program by setting option "
"ortho_cabs=1 (which has been and still is the default if the cabs correction"
" is computed with df-cabs or in non-PNO F12 calculations)."
msgstr ""
"在大规模情况下，基组正交归一化和 Fock 矩阵块对角化所需的非并行对角化可能比 Fock 矩阵评估花费更多时间。为了减少对角化时间，PNO "
"程序默认使用 ORTHO_CABS=0。这节省了一次大规模对角化，但对相对能量的影响可以忽略不计。可以通过在 PNO 程序中设置选项 "
"ortho_cabs=1 来覆盖此默认值（如果 cabs 校正是用 df-cabs 或在非 PNO F12 "
"计算中计算的，这曾经是并且现在仍然是默认值）。"

msgid "Improved PNO domain selection in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 中改进的 PNO 域选择"

msgid "Additional options in the PNO region program"
msgstr "PNO 区域程序中的附加选项"

msgid ""
"Additional options to define region-specific domain options and to extend "
"the center list for each region are available, see "
"`local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos#Correlation "
"regions in the PNO program [REGION "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#correlation-"
"regions-in-the-pno-program-region>`__]."
msgstr ""
"现在提供了用于定义区域特定域选项以及扩展每个区域中心列表的附加选项，详见 "
"`local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos#Correlation "
"regions in the PNO program [REGION "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#correlation-"
"regions-in-the-pno-program-region>`__]。"

msgid "Restarts with INTERACT"
msgstr "INTERACT 程序的重启功能"

msgid ""
"The restart possibilities in the INTERACT program have been improved. It is "
"now possible to carry out calculations without counterpoise corrections or "
"monomer relaxation calculations with a restart after a completed CP "
"calculation. See `Interact "
"<properties_and_expectation_values.html#intermolecular-interaction-"
"energies>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"INTERACT 程序的重启功能已得到改进。现在可以在完成 CP 计算后，进行无需均衡校正的计算或单体弛豫计算的重启。详情请参阅 `Interact "
"<properties_and_expectation_values.html#intermolecularinteractionenergies>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid "CC2 properties and transition moments"
msgstr "CC2 性质和跃迁矩"

msgid "Finite field property calculations"
msgstr "有限场性质计算"

msgid ""
"New automatic procedures to simplify the calculation of properties like "
"multipole moments or polarizabilities using finite field approximations have"
" been added."
msgstr "已添加新的自动化程序，以简化使用有限场近似计算多极矩或极化率等性质的过程。"

msgid "Self-consistent random phase approximation method"
msgstr "自洽随机相位近似方法"

msgid ""
"The self-consistent random phase approximation method (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4818984>`__ 139, 084113 (2013), `Phys. Rev. Lett."
" <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.134.016402>`__ 134, 016402 (2025)) is "
"now available within the `SCRPA program <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#scrpa-program>`__. The program uses the optimized "
"effective potential method to construct the exact exchange potential and the"
" random phase approximation correlation potential. The `SCEXX program <kohn-"
"sham_random-phase_approximation.html#scexx-program>`__ offers the self-"
"consistent exact exchange optimized effective potential method (`J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.2751159>`__ 127, 054102 (2007), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://aip.scitation.org/doi/full/10.1063/5.0056431>`__ 155, 054109 "
"(2021)) that neglects correlation."
msgstr ""
"自洽随机相位近似方法 (`J. Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4818984>`__ 139, "
"084113 (2013), `Phys. Rev. Lett. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.134.016402>`__ 134, 016402 (2025)) 现已在 "
"`SCRPA 程序 <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#scrpa-program>`__ "
"中可用。该程序使用优化有效势方法来构建精确交换势和随机相位近似相关势。\\ `SCEXX 程序 <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#scexx-program>`__ 提供了忽略相关性的自洽精确交换优化有效势方法 (`J. Chem."
" Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.2751159>`__ 127, 054102 (2007), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://aip.scitation.org/doi/full/10.1063/5.0056431>`__ 155, 054109 "
"(2021))。"

msgid "Enhanced interface with other codes"
msgstr "增强的与其他代码的接口"

msgid ""
"Molpro can now read and write geometries to/from `TREXIO <https://trex-"
"coe.github.io/trexio/>`__ files."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 现在可以读取和写入几何结构到/从 `TREXIO <https://trex-coe.github.io/trexio/>`__ 文件。"

msgid ""
"New features have also been added to `pymolpro "
"<https://github.com/molpro/pymolpro>`__:"
msgstr "新功能也已添加到 `pymolpro <https://github.com/molpro/pymolpro>`__ 中："

msgid ""
"Export geometry, basis set and orbitals to a `TREXIO <https://trex-"
"coe.github.io/trexio/>`__ file."
msgstr "将几何结构、基组和轨道导出到 `TREXIO <https://trex-coe.github.io/trexio/>`__ 文件。"

msgid ""
"`Prepare and launch Molpro runs "
"<https://molpro.github.io/pymolpro/pymolpro.html#pymolpro.ASEMolpro>`__ "
"within the `Atomic Simulation Environment (ASE) "
"<https://wiki.fysik.dtu.dk/ase/>`__"
msgstr ""
"在 `原子模拟环境 (ASE) <https://wiki.fysik.dtu.dk/ase/>`__ 中 `准备和启动 Molpro 计算 "
"<https://molpro.github.io/pymolpro/pymolpro.html#pymolpro.ASEMolpro>`__"

msgid "GUI gmolpro 2.9.0"
msgstr "图形用户界面 gmolpro 2.9.0"

msgid ""
"gmolpro version 2.9.0 should be used together with Molpro2025.3. On Mac, the"
" package you download is already bundled with this Molpro version."
msgstr "gmolpro 版本 2.9.0 应与 Molpro2025.3 配合使用。在 Mac 上，您下载的软件包已捆绑此 Molpro 版本。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro 2.8.0"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro 2.8.0"

msgid ""
"gmolpro version 2.8.0 should be used together with Molpro2025.2. On Mac, the"
" package you download is already bundled with this Molpro version."
msgstr "gmolpro 版本 2.8.0 应与 Molpro2025.2 配合使用。在 Mac 上，您下载的软件包已捆绑此 Molpro 版本。"

msgid ""
"The basis set library of Molpro had been extended, and gmolpro has been "
"correspondingly adjusted."
msgstr "Molpro 的基组库已扩展，gmolpro 也相应进行了调整。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro 2.7.0"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro 2.7.0"

msgid ""
"gmolpro version 2.7.0 should be used together with Molpro2025.1. On Mac, the"
" package you download is already bundled with this Molpro version. On Linux,"
" gmolpro does not come bundled with Molpro, and you need a separate "
"installation of Molpro."
msgstr ""
"gmolpro 版本 2.7.0 应与 Molpro2025.1 配合使用。在 Mac 上，您下载的软件包已捆绑此 Molpro 版本。在 Linux "
"上，gmolpro 不捆绑 Molpro，您需要单独安装 Molpro。"

msgid ""
"A trajectory can be visualised, i.e. a set of xyz files appended to each "
"other. In the builder window, do ``Geometry/Import to builder window...``"
msgstr ""
"可以可视化轨迹，即一组相互追加的 xyz 文件。在构建器窗口中，执行 ``Geometry/Import to builder window…``"

msgid ""
"The box in which orbitals are plotted can be enlarged so that very diffuse "
"orbitals can be plotted."
msgstr "绘制轨道的框可以放大，以便绘制非常弥散的轨道。"

msgid ""
"Molpro versions beyond 2025.1 will need gmolpro version at least 2.7.0 "
"because the xml file will be split in xml and xml-sidecar"
msgstr ""
"2025.1 版本之后的 Molpro 将需要至少 2.7.0 版本的 gmolpro，因为 xml 文件将被拆分为 xml 和 xml-"
"sidecar。"

msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "错误修复"

msgid ""
"A bug has been fixed where double hybrid DFT calculations gave different "
"results in serial and parallel calculations. The scaling factor to the MP2 "
"correlation energy is now applied both in serial and in parallel mode "
"(before it was only applied in serial DH calculations). See section `Double-"
"hybrid functionals (DH, DSDH) <the_density_functional_program.html#double-"
"hybrid-functionals-dh-dsdh>`__ for more info."
msgstr ""
"一个导致双杂化 DFT 计算在串行和并行模式下给出不同结果的错误已被修复。现在，MP2 相关能的标度因子在串行和并行模式下均被应用（此前仅应用于串行 "
"DH 计算）。更多信息请参阅章节 `Double-hybrid functionals (DH, DSDH) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#double-hybrid-functionals-dh-dsdh>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2025.2"
msgstr "MOLPRO2025.2 的新特性"

msgid "Interact"
msgstr "交互"

msgid ""
"A minor bug concerning the PNO-LCCSD(T\\*) triples scaling has been fixed. "
"The effect of the bug is negligible."
msgstr "一个关于 PNO-LCCSD(T\\*) 三重激发标度的微小错误已被修复。该错误的影响可以忽略不计。"

msgid ""
"The def2-QZVPP MP2FIT basis for Ba has been replaced by a newer version. The"
" old version can be accessed as def2-QZVPPO."
msgstr "Ba 的 def2-QZVPP MP2FIT 基组已被新版本取代。旧版本可通过 def2-QZVPPO 访问。"

msgid "Nuclear-Electronic Orbital DFT"
msgstr "核-电子轨道 DFT"

msgid ""
"Density-fitted NEO-DFT is now available. The program is currently limited to"
" the use of standard numerical integration grids (SG1-3). The electron-"
"proton correlation functionals currently available through the libxc library"
" are the epc17.1, epc17.2, epc18.1 and epc18.2. Multicomponent basis sets "
"(cc-pV\\ *n*\\ Z-mc, aug-cc-pV\\ *n*\\ Z-mc) from Brorsen and coworkers are "
"now provided in the Molpro basis set library."
msgstr ""
"密度拟合 NEO-DFT 现已可用。该程序目前仅限于使用标准数值积分网格（SG1-3）。当前通过 libxc 库可用的电子-质子相关泛函包括 "
"epc17.1、epc17.2、epc18.1 和 epc18.2。来自 Brorsen 及其同事的多组分基组（cc-pV\\ *n*\\ Z-mc, "
"aug-cc-pV\\ *n*\\ Z-mc）现已包含在 Molpro 基组库中。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2025.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2025.1 的新功能"

msgid ""
"Various bug fixes. Most notably, a bug that led to a wrong Hartree-Fock "
"starting guess in the presence of ECPs has been fixed. In some cases an "
"error occurred, in others no or very erratic HF convergence resulted. This "
"only occurred if: (i) a segmented or core-valence (CV) basis set was used; "
"(ii) two atoms of the same kind followed each other in the geometry before "
"an atom with ECP; (iii) and/or symmetry was used which reflected atoms into "
"each other. The error did not occur with [a]vnz[-f12] basis sets."
msgstr ""
"各种错误修复。最值得注意的是，修复了一个在存在 ECP 时导致 Hartree-Fock 初始猜测错误的 "
"bug。在某些情况下会发生错误，在其他情况下则导致没有或非常不稳定的 HF 收敛。这仅在以下情况发生：(i) 使用了分段或芯-价（CV）基组；(ii) "
"在具有 ECP 的原子之前，几何结构中两个同种原子彼此相邻；(iii) 和/或使用了将原子相互映射的对称性。该错误在使用 [a]vnz[-f12] "
"基组时不会发生。"

msgid "Basis sets"
msgstr "基组"

msgid ""
"New Pseudopotentials and associated basis sets have been added for several "
"3d transition metals."
msgstr "已为几种 3d 过渡金属添加了新的赝势及相关基组。"

msgid ""
"A new program to automatically compute CP-corrected interaction energies has"
" been added, see `Interact "
"<properties_and_expectation_values.html#intermolecular-interaction-"
"energies>`__"
msgstr ""
"已添加一个新程序来自动计算 CP 校正的相互作用能，请参阅 `Interact "
"<properties_and_expectation_values.html#intermolecularinteractionenergies>`__"

msgid "PNO regions"
msgstr "PNO 区域"

msgid "Binaries and parallelism"
msgstr "二进制文件与并行性"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2024.4"
msgstr "MOLPRO2024.4 的新功能"

msgid "Bug fixes."
msgstr "错误修复。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2024.3"
msgstr "MOLPRO2024.3 的新功能"

msgid "Molpro now uses Libxc 7.0.0."
msgstr "Molpro 现在使用 Libxc 7.0.0。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2024.2"
msgstr "MOLPRO2024.2 的新功能"

msgid "CC2 excitation energies"
msgstr "CC2激发能"

msgid ""
"An efficient new density-fitted CC2 Program for the calculation of "
"excitation energies has been added."
msgstr "已添加一个用于计算激发能的高效新密度拟合CC2程序。"

msgid "PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 region approximations"
msgstr "PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12区域近似"

msgid ""
"Correlation regions have been implemented into the PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 program."
" It allows to define uncorrelated (HF), low-level (LMP2-F12), and high-level"
" (PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12) correlation regions in a molecule using lists of "
"orbitals or atoms."
msgstr ""
"相关区域已实现到PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12程序中。它允许使用轨道或原子列表在分子中定义不相关（HF）、低级别（LMP2-F12）和高级别（PNO-"
"LCCSD(T)-F12）相关区域。"

msgid "Generalised basis set input"
msgstr "广义基组输入"

msgid ""
"Atom-specific default basis sets can now be defined for ranges of atoms."
msgstr "现在可以为原子范围定义原子特定的默认基组。"

msgid "Some old programs have been removed"
msgstr "一些旧程序已被移除"

msgid ""
"The following very old programs, which have redundant functionality with "
"more recent ones, have been removed: CADPAC gradients, distributed multipole"
" approximations (DMA), and an old spin-orbit integral code."
msgstr "以下非常旧的程序，其功能与较新的程序冗余，已被移除：CADPAC梯度、分布多极近似（DMA）以及一个旧的自旋-轨道积分代码。"

msgid "Input syntax"
msgstr "输入语法"

msgid ""
"Change in input files using a z-matrix: Previously both Q and X could be "
"used for dummy atoms in a z-matrix. Now, only X should be used."
msgstr "使用 Z-矩阵的输入文件变更：以前在 Z-矩阵中，哑原子可以使用 Q 或 X 表示。现在，应仅使用 X。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro 2.5.0"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro 2.5.0"

msgid ""
"The colors of the labels (``Display/Labels``) in the builder window are now "
"white, in the viewer window black. In the viewer window, there is in "
"addition the option ``Options/Graphics/Adaptive Label Colors``"
msgstr ""
"构建器窗口中的标签颜色（\\ ``Display/Labels``\\ ）现在为白色，查看器窗口中为黑色。在查看器窗口中，还增加了选项 "
"``Options/Graphics/Adaptive Label Colors``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Improved compatibility with iMolpro (xyz files from iMolpro are now shown in"
" the builder when opening an iMolpro-project with gmolpro)."
msgstr ""
"改进了与 iMolpro 的兼容性（现在在 gmolpro 中打开 iMolpro 项目时，构建器会显示来自 iMolpro 的 xyz 文件）。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro 2.4.0"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro 2.4.0"

msgid ""
"A window appears below the brown viewer window, to display the xyz file of "
"the structure presently in the viewer; continuously updated even during "
"vibrations. It can be opened/closed with the menu item ``Window/Show xyz "
"file``"
msgstr ""
"在棕色查看器窗口下方会出现一个窗口，用于显示当前查看器中结构的 xyz 文件；即使在振动过程中也会持续更新。可以通过菜单项 ``Window/Show "
"xyz file`` 打开/关闭它。"

msgid "Better placement of the windows on startup."
msgstr "启动时窗口布局更佳。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2024.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2024.1 的新特性"

msgid "Various bug fixes and improvements of existing methods."
msgstr "现有方法的各种错误修复与改进。"

msgid "iMolpro"
msgstr "iMolpro"

msgid ""
"A new graphical user interface called ``iMolpro`` is now included without "
"additional charge. This can be used for generating Molpro inputs for DFT and"
" all single reference methods, and submit these for execution to a chosen "
"machine. This functionality is very much like in gMolpro. In addition, "
"structures, orbitals, and vibrations can be viewed using Jmol."
msgstr ""
"一个名为 ``iMolpro`` 的新图形用户界面现已免费包含在内。它可用于为 DFT 和所有单参考方法生成 Molpro "
"输入文件，并将这些文件提交到选定的机器上执行。此功能与 gMolpro 中的非常相似。此外，可以使用 Jmol 查看结构、轨道和振动。"

msgid "D4 dispersion correction"
msgstr "D4 色散校正"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately this has been wrong (usually too small) for pseudo-potential "
"calculations. This bug has been fixed."
msgstr "不幸的是，对于赝势计算，这一直是错误的（通常太小）。此错误已修复。"

msgid "DFT functional alias names"
msgstr "DFT 泛函别名"

msgid ""
"Many alias names for functionals computed with libxc have been added. These "
"are compatible with those used in the D4 program."
msgstr "已添加许多用于通过 libxc 计算的泛函的别名。这些与 D4 程序中使用的别名兼容。"

msgid "Density-based basis set correction"
msgstr "基于密度的基组校正"

msgid ""
"This program has been very much speeded up, with and without density "
"fitting. Various functionals can now be used in it."
msgstr "该程序已大幅提速，无论是否使用密度拟合。现在可在其中使用多种泛函。"

msgid "Internally Contracted Multireference Coupled-Cluster Theory"
msgstr "内收缩多参考耦合簇理论"

msgid ""
"A CAS(2,2) version of icMRCCSD is now available, as published in `J. Chem. "
"Phys. 158, 134801 (2023) <https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0143214>`__."
msgstr ""
"现已提供 CAS(2,2) 版本的 icMRCCSD，如 `J. Chem. Phys. 158, 134801 (2023) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0143214>`__ 中发表。"

msgid "PNO-LMP2-F12 / PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "PNO-LMP2-F12 / PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12"

msgid ""
"New variables EMP2F12_PNO and EMP2F12_OSV are set for MP2-F12 energies "
"computed with PNO or PAO/OSV projector, respectively. This happens in "
"calculations with option projector=PAO or projector=MIXED."
msgstr ""
"现已设置新变量 EMP2F12_PNO 和 EMP2F12_OSV，分别用于通过 PNO 或 PAO/OSV 投影器计算的 MP2-F12 "
"能量。这在选项 projector=PAO 或 projector=MIXED 的计算中生效。"

msgid "Nuclear-electronic orbital (NEO) methods"
msgstr "核-电子轨道 (NEO) 方法"

msgid ""
"A new automated procedure for the optimisation of quantum nuclei positions "
"has been introduced (adaptive-NEO). The latter works by updating the nuclei "
"position (meaning the nuclear basis centers, together with the respective "
"electronic basis functions) to the nuclear orbital centroids during the SCF "
"cycles. See `Adaptive NEO <nuclear-electronic_orbital_method.html#adaptive-"
"neo>`__ for further information."
msgstr ""
"已引入一种新的量子核位置优化自动化程序（自适应-NEO）。其工作原理是在 SCF "
"循环期间将核位置（即核基组中心及其相应的电子基函数）更新为核轨道质心。详见 `Adaptive NEO <nuclear-"
"electronic_orbital_method.html#adaptiveneo>`__ 获取更多信息。"

msgid "Basis set short names"
msgstr "基组简称"

msgid ""
"The short names [awc]vnz-dk (n=d,t,q,5) now refer to the "
"[aug]-cc-p[wC]V(n+d)Z-DK sets for second-row elements Al-Cl. To avoid using "
"the +d sets (not recommended!) use the full basis set name."
msgstr ""
"简称 [awc]vnz-dk (n=d,t,q,5) 现在指代第二行元素 Al-Cl 的 [aug]-cc-p[wC]V(n+d)Z-DK "
"基组。为避免使用 +d 基组（不推荐！），请使用完整的基组名称。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro 2.3.0"
msgstr "图形用户界面 gmolpro 2.3.0"

msgid "Version 2.3.0 is bundled with Molpro 2024.1 ."
msgstr "版本 2.3.0 已与 Molpro 2024.1 捆绑发布。"

msgid ""
"LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE is set to be true. This avoids a crash on some Linux "
"distributions, which is due to a bug in the Mesa library."
msgstr ""
"LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE 被设置为 true。这避免了在某些 Linux 发行版上因 Mesa 库的 bug 导致的崩溃。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2023.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2023.1 的新功能"

msgid ""
"Molpro 2023.2 is a bug-fix release with the same features as Molpro 2023.1"
msgstr "Molpro 2023.2 是一个错误修复版本，其功能与 Molpro 2023.1 相同。"

msgid "Binaries for calculations on multiple nodes"
msgstr "用于多节点计算的二进制文件"

msgid ""
"The Linux MPI-PR binary now supports parallel calculations on multiple "
"computer nodes based on UCX (which must be installed on the cluster). "
"Currently, multi-node calculations are restricted to closed-and open-shell "
"DF-HF, DF-KS, and PNO-LCCSD(T). It is generally recommended to use the MPI-"
"PR version for parallel calculations, since it is more stable than the "
"sockets version and does not require GA preallocation (-G option). Note, "
"however, that multi-node calculations can be very slow unless a fast network"
" (e.g. Infiniband) is available."
msgstr ""
"Linux MPI-PR 二进制文件现在支持基于 UCX（必须在集群上安装）在多计算机节点上进行并行计算。目前，多节点计算仅限于闭壳层和开壳层 DF-"
"HF、DF-KS 和 PNO-LCCSD(T)。通常建议使用 MPI-PR 版本进行并行计算，因为它比套接字版本更稳定，并且不需要 GA 预分配（-G "
"选项）。但请注意，除非有高速网络（例如 Infiniband），否则多节点计算可能非常缓慢。"

msgid "Unrestricted coupled cluster"
msgstr "非限制性耦合簇"

msgid "Improved geometry optimization"
msgstr "改进的几何优化"

msgid "DFT Grids"
msgstr "DFT 网格"

msgid ""
"Rotationally invariant DFT grids have been implemented and is used by "
"default. This is achieved by rotating the grid of each atom dependent of its"
" local environment (see section `Atomic grid orientation (ORIENT) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#orientation-of-atomic-grids-"
"orient>`__)."
msgstr ""
"旋转不变 DFT 网格已实现并默认使用。这是通过根据每个原子的局部环境旋转其网格来实现的（请参阅章节 `Atomic grid orientation "
"(ORIENT) <the_density_functional_program.html#orientation-of-atomic-grids-"
"orient>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Treatment of core correlation in PNO methods"
msgstr "PNO方法中的芯层相关处理"

msgid "Basis set extrapolation based on a DFT model"
msgstr "基于DFT模型的基组外推"

msgid ""
"The basis set incompleteness error correction based on a DFT model by E. "
"Giner and J. Toulouse (`J. Phys. Chem. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.9b01176>`__ **10**, 2931 (2019)) has"
" been implemented, see section `Basis set incompleteness error correction "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#basis-set-incompleteness-error-correction-"
"using-a-dft-model-of-short-ranged-electron-interactions>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"基于E. Giner和J. Toulouse的DFT模型的基组不完备性误差校正（\\ `J. Phys. Chem. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.9b01176>`__ **10**, 2931 "
"(2019)）已实现，详情请参见 `Basis set extrapolation "
"<basis_set_extrapolation.html#basis-set-incompleteness-error-correction-"
"using-a-dft-model-of-short-ranged-electron-interactions>`__ 章节中的 `Basis set "
"incompleteness error correction <basis_set_extrapolation.html#basis-set-"
"incompleteness-error-correction-using-a-dft-model-of-short-ranged-electron-"
"interactions>`__\\ 。"

msgid "σ-functionals and RPA calculations with RIRPA code"
msgstr "RIRPA代码中的σ泛函与RPA计算"

msgid ""
"The σ-functionals developed by Görling and coworkers (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://aip.scitation.org/doi/full/10.1063/5.0026849>`__ 154, 014104 "
"(2021), `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://aip.scitation.org/doi/abs/10.1063/5.0059641>`__ 155, 134111 (2021))"
" are implemented in the RIRPA code. See the corresponding section in the "
"manual for details: `RIRPA program <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#rirpa-program>`__. σ-functionals are as fast as "
"RPA, but provide more accurate results for many chemical properties."
msgstr ""
"由Görling及其合作者开发的σ泛函（\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://aip.scitation.org/doi/full/10.1063/5.0026849>`__ 154, 014104 "
"(2021), `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://aip.scitation.org/doi/abs/10.1063/5.0059641>`__ 155, 134111 "
"(2021)）已在RIRPA代码中实现。详情请参见手册中的相应章节：Kohn-Sham random-phase approximation#RIRPA"
" program。σ泛函与RPA一样快速，但对许多化学性质能提供更准确的结果。"

msgid "The CISPT2 method"
msgstr "CISPT2方法"

msgid ""
"A new variant of multi-reference perturbation theory, denoted cispt2, has "
"been added. This adds a perturbative double correction to a MRCI-singles "
"(MRCIS) calculation. The initial MRCIS relaxes the reference coefficients "
"before generating the internally contracted doubles.  Valence excitation "
"energies are more accurate than with CASPT2 or NEVPT2."
msgstr ""
"新增了一种多参考微扰理论的变体，称为cispt2。该方法在MRCI单激发态（MRCIS）计算基础上增加了微扰双激发校正。初始的MRCIS在生成内收缩双激发态之前会先松弛参考系数。对于价层激发能，其精度高于CASPT2或NEVPT2。"

msgid "Bug fixes in NEVPT2"
msgstr "NEVPT2的错误修复"

msgid ""
"Some problems in NEVPT2 have been fixed, and tighter default integral "
"screening thresholds for DF-NEVPT2 have been set."
msgstr "NEVPT2中的一些问题已得到修复，并为DF-NEVPT2设置了更严格的默认积分筛选阈值。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro version 2.2.0"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro 版本 2.2.0"

msgid ""
"Version 2.2.0 of the graphical user interface gmolpro is bundled with "
"Molpro2023.2.0 . When installing gmolpro, then it is installed together with"
" this Molpro version, and uses this version on the local machine."
msgstr ""
"图形用户界面gmolpro的2.2.0版本已与Molpro2023.2.0捆绑。安装gmolpro时，它将与此Molpro版本一同安装，并在本地机器上使用此版本。"

msgid "Due to moving to gtk2.24, the menu bar on Mac is better synchronised."
msgstr "由于迁移到gtk2.24，Mac上的菜单栏同步性更好。"

msgid ""
"Important: on some platforms such as openSUSE15.5, ``export "
"LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1`` or ``export MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE=i965`` may"
" be necessary before starting gmolpro , to avoid a crash (because of a bug "
"in the Mesa library)"
msgstr ""
"重要提示：在某些平台（如openSUSE15.5）上，启动gmolpro之前可能需要设置\\ ``export "
"LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1``\\ 或\\ ``export "
"MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE=i965``\\ ，以避免崩溃（由于Mesa库中的一个错误）。"

msgid "Frequently asked question:"
msgstr "常见问题："

msgid ""
"A: The GUI searches for orbitals, and generates a pulldown menu with a set "
"of orbitals found. If there is more than one set of orbitals, then it may be"
" necessary to load a different set of orbitals. If a corresponding "
"optimisation (or frequency) calculation is found, then the icon to open the "
"window will become clickable (and is not greyed out any more)."
msgstr ""
"答：图形用户界面会搜索轨道，并生成一个下拉菜单，其中包含找到的一组轨道。如果存在多组轨道，则可能需要加载另一组轨道。如果找到了相应的优化（或频率）计算，则用于打开窗口的图标将变为可点击状态（不再显示为灰色）。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2022.3"
msgstr "MOLPRO2022.3 的新功能"

msgid "MPPX option"
msgstr "MPPX 选项"

msgid "Coupled-cluster calculations using KS orbitals"
msgstr "使用 KS 轨道的耦合簇计算"

msgid ""
"It is now possible to run CCSD or CCSD(T) calculations using orbitals from a"
" previous Kohn-Sham (KS) calculation. New options ``H0=MP|KS`` and "
"``KSFOCK`` have been added. With ``H0=MP`` (default, Moeller-Plesset zeroth-"
"order Hamiltonian) the Fock matrix is recomputed using the KS orbitals and "
"block-diagonalised, while with ``H0=KS`` the KS Fock matrix is used as "
"zeroth-order Hamiltonian, and thus the KS orbital energies in the "
"denominators in the perturbative MP2 and triples steps. In both cases single"
" excitations are included in the MP2 step (this is also possible with DF-"
"MP2). Single excitations can be excluded using option ``NOSINGLES``."
msgstr ""
"现在可以使用先前 Kohn-Sham (KS) 计算得到的轨道来运行 CCSD 或 CCSD(T) 计算。新增了选项 ``H0=MP|KS`` 和 "
"``KSFOCK``\\ 。使用 ``H0=MP``\\ （默认，Moeller-Plesset 零阶哈密顿量）时，会使用 KS 轨道重新计算 Fock"
" 矩阵并进行块对角化；而使用 ``H0=KS`` 时，KS Fock 矩阵被用作零阶哈密顿量，因此在微扰 MP2 和三重组步骤的分母中使用 KS "
"轨道能量。在这两种情况下，MP2 步骤中都包含了单激发（这在 DF-MP2 中也是可能的）。可以使用选项 ``NOSINGLES`` 来排除单激发。"

msgid ""
"Option ``KSFOCK`` forces the use of the KS Fock matrix in the subsequent "
"calculation. This is required for double-hybrid DFT and RPA calculations."
msgstr "选项 ``KSFOCK`` 强制在后续计算中使用 KS Fock 矩阵。这对于双杂化 DFT 和 RPA 计算是必需的。"

msgid ""
"Note that the (T) energies are still slightly different in closed-shell CCSD"
" and UCCSD calculations. This is due to missing singles terms in the closed-"
"shell triples program. Work is in progress to fix this problem."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在闭壳层 CCSD 和 UCCSD 计算中，(T) 能量仍然略有不同。这是由于闭壳层三重激发程序中缺少单激发项所致。目前正在努力修复此问题。"

msgid "PNO methods:"
msgstr "PNO 方法："

msgid "MRCI restart:"
msgstr "MRCI 重启："

msgid ""
"A bug in the MRCI restart with stored reference vectors has been fixed."
msgstr "MRCI 重启中存储参考向量的一个错误已被修复。"

msgid "NEVPT2:"
msgstr "NEVPT2："

msgid ""
"The maximum number of active orbitals in NEVPT2 has been increased from 14 "
"to 32."
msgstr "NEVPT2 中活性轨道的最大数量已从 14 个增加到 32 个。"

msgid "RS2 Gradients"
msgstr "RS2 梯度"

msgid ""
"An parallelisation problem occurring with large reference spaces has been "
"fixed. The performance and parallelisation of some parts of the gradient "
"program have been improved."
msgstr "已修复在处理大参考空间时出现的并行化问题。梯度程序部分模块的性能和并行化已得到改进。"

msgid "Rovibrational Spectra:"
msgstr "转动振动光谱："

msgid ""
"The existing VCI program has been extended by a new directive (ROVIB), which"
" allows for the automated calculation of high-resolution rotational and "
"rovibrational spectra based on RVCI theory. Rotational and Coriolis coupling"
" can be included up to high accuracy and several rotational bases are "
"provided. As the final line lists can be very long, they are stored in an "
"external file, which can be further processed by the DAT2GR program in order"
" to simulate the corresponding spectra. To allow for maximal flexibility "
"with respect to the vibrational bases, the VIBSTATE program has been "
"significantly extended and controls now for all parts of the VSCF/VCI "
"programs the list of states to be computed - including non-Abelian point "
"groups (see the VSCF manual)."
msgstr ""
"现有的 VCI 程序已通过一个新的指令 (ROVIB) 进行了扩展，该指令允许基于 RVCI "
"理论自动计算高分辨率的转动和转动振动光谱。转动和科里奥利耦合可以高精度地包含在内，并提供了多种转动基组。由于最终谱线列表可能非常长，它们被存储在一个外部文件中，该文件可以由"
" DAT2GR 程序进一步处理以模拟相应的光谱。为了在振动基组方面获得最大的灵活性，VIBSTATE 程序已得到显著扩展，现在可为 VSCF/VCI "
"程序的所有部分控制待计算的状态列表——包括非阿贝尔点群（参见 VSCF 手册）。"

msgid ""
"NMR shielding tensors can be computed with LDA, GGA and hybrid GGA "
"functionals using density fitting approximations of two-electron integrals "
"using the new ``dftshield`` program. The program is restricted to closed-"
"shell systems and currently does not support symmetry."
msgstr ""
"NMR 屏蔽张量可以使用 LDA、GGA 和杂化 GGA 泛函，通过新的 ``dftshield`` "
"程序，利用双电子积分的密度拟合近似进行计算。该程序仅限于闭壳层体系，目前不支持对称性。"

msgid "Documentation of default basis sets"
msgstr "默认基组文档"

msgid ""
"The documentation of default basis sets in Molpro has been extended, see "
"section `Default basis sets <basis_input.html#default-basis-sets>`__"
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中默认基组的文档已得到扩展，请参阅章节 `默认基组 <basis_input.html#defaultbasissets>`__"

msgid "Cartesian basis functions:"
msgstr "笛卡尔基函数："

msgid ""
"The input specifications for cartesian basis functions have been "
"generalised. It is no possible to specify option ``CARTESIAN`` or "
"``ATTRIBUTES=CARTESIAN`` on basis set ``SET`` directives, e.g. "
"``SET,JK,CONTEXT=JKFIT,CARTESIAN``. It should be noted, however, that "
"density fitting with cartesian basis functions is much slower than with "
"spherical ones. F12 calculations with cartesian basis functions are not "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"笛卡尔基函数的输入规范已得到泛化。现在可以在基组 ``SET`` 指令上指定选项 ``CARTESIAN`` 或 "
"``ATTRIBUTES=CARTESIAN``\\ ，例如 ``SET,JK,CONTEXT=JKFIT,CARTESIAN``\\ "
"。但需注意，使用笛卡尔基函数进行密度拟合比使用球谐基函数慢得多。使用笛卡尔基函数进行 F12 计算是不可能的。"

msgid ""
"The pymolpro Python package has been released, and is available via conda-"
"forge.  This supports the same Molpro project bundles as the gmolpro GUI, "
"and allows the programmatic construction, running and analysis of Molpro "
"jobs. For details, see https://molpro.github.io/pymolpro/ and "
"https://github.com/molpro/pymolpro"
msgstr ""
"pymolpro Python 包已发布，可通过 conda-forge 获取。它支持与 gmolpro GUI 相同的 Molpro "
"项目包，并允许以编程方式构建、运行和分析 Molpro 任务。详情请参阅 https://molpro.github.io/pymolpro/ 和 "
"https://github.com/molpro/pymolpro"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2022.2"
msgstr "MOLPRO2022.2 的新特性"

msgid ""
"Various problems concerning the use of cartesian basis functions have been "
"fixed, including the starting guess and AVAS. Density fitting now works for "
"cartesian basis sets up to h-functions."
msgstr "与使用笛卡尔基函数相关的各种问题已得到修复，包括初始猜测和 AVAS。密度拟合现在适用于最高至 h 函数的笛卡尔基组。"

msgid ""
"The default of DFT grid option orient has been change to 1; this makes KS "
"energies rotationally invariant, but may slightly change energies (mostly in"
" the microhartree range. To recover the old behaviour add grid option "
"orient=1."
msgstr ""
"DFT 格点选项 orient 的默认值已更改为 1；这使得 KS "
"能量具有旋转不变性，但可能会略微改变能量值（主要在微哈特里量级）。要恢复旧行为，请添加格点选项 orient=1。"

msgid ""
"A new `F12 projector option "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#options-"
"for-f12-calculations>`__ is added to the PNO-LCCSD program. Different F12 "
"geminal exponents for valence, core-valence, and core-core pairs are now "
"supported. See `GEM_BETA <explicitly_correlated_methods.html#options>`__ for"
" details."
msgstr ""
"PNO-LCCSD 程序中新增了一个 `F12 投影算符选项 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#optionsforf12calculations>`__\\"
" 。现在支持对价层、芯-价层和芯-芯对使用不同的 F12 双电子指数。详情请参阅 `GEM_BETA "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#options>`__\\ 。"

msgid "DFT  options for controlling grid accuracy have been added to gmolpro."
msgstr "用于控制网格精度的DFT选项已添加到gmolpro中。"

msgid ""
"OPTG options for choosing optimization methods and coordinates have been "
"added to gmolpro."
msgstr "用于选择优化方法和坐标的OPTG选项已添加到gmolpro中。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro version 2.1.0"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro 版本 2.1.0"

msgid ""
"Version 2.1.0 of the graphical user interface gmolpro is bundled with "
"Molpro2022.2.3 . When installing gmolpro, then it is installed together with"
" Molpro version 2022.2.3 , and uses this version on the local machine."
msgstr ""
"图形用户界面gmolpro的2.1.0版本与Molpro2022.2.3捆绑发布。安装gmolpro时，它将与Molpro版本2022.2.3一同安装，并在本地机器上使用此版本。"

msgid ""
"A slider to change the vibrational amplitudes has been added. As before, the"
" animation speed can be changed with Options/Graphics/Animation Speed"
msgstr "已添加用于改变振动幅度的滑块。与之前一样，动画速度可通过选项/图形/动画速度进行更改。"

msgid ""
"The xyz-geometry in the builder window is now displayed in a little extra "
"window."
msgstr "构建器窗口中的xyz几何结构现在显示在一个额外的小窗口中。"

msgid ""
"Various bug fixes: z-matrix containing dummy atoms now properly written by "
"Molpro, so that gmolpro correctly displays it; small window (segment window)"
" in builder: hydrogens + dummies properly displayed etc."
msgstr ""
"多项错误修复：包含哑原子的 Z-矩阵现在可由 Molpro 正确写入，从而使 gmolpro "
"能正确显示它；构建器中的小窗口（片段窗口）：氢原子和哑原子等能正确显示。"

msgid "Force-field parameters autodetected when importing xyz."
msgstr "导入 xyz 文件时自动检测力场参数。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro version 2.0.0"
msgstr "图形用户界面 gmolpro 版本 2.0.0"

msgid ""
"Version 2.0.0 of the graphical user interface gmolpro is bundled with "
"Molpro2022.2.2 . When installing gmolpro, then it is installed together with"
" Molpro version 2022.2.2 , and uses this version on the local machine."
msgstr ""
"图形用户界面 gmolpro 的 2.0.0 版本与 Molpro2022.2.2 捆绑。安装 gmolpro 时，它将与 Molpro 版本 "
"2022.2.2 一同安装，并在本地机器上使用此版本。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2022.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2022.1 的新功能"

msgid "Update 2022.1.2"
msgstr "更新 2022.1.2"

msgid ""
"A bug affecting KS and TDDFT calculations with cartesian basis functions has"
" been fixed."
msgstr "一个影响使用笛卡尔基函数进行 KS 和 TDDFT 计算的错误已被修复。"

msgid "Perturbation-Adapted Perturbation Theory (PAPT)"
msgstr "微扰适应微扰理论 (PAPT)"

msgid ""
"The perturbation-adapted zero-order hamiltonian described in J. Chem. Phys. "
"156, 011101 (2022); https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0079853 is available for "
"closed-shell systems."
msgstr ""
"J. Chem. Phys. 156, 011101 (2022); https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0079853 "
"中描述的微扰适应零阶哈密顿量现已可用于闭壳层体系。"

msgid "CORE directive"
msgstr "CORE 指令"

msgid ""
"Quadratic optimization or mixed quadratic/first-order SO-SCI optimization is"
" available for closed-shell and open-shell RHF by using ``{RHF,SO;...}`` or "
"``{RHF,SO-SCI;...}``."
msgstr ""
"通过使用 ``{RHF,SO;…}`` 或 ``{RHF,SO-SCI;…}``\\ ，二次优化或混合二次/一阶 SO-SCI "
"优化现已可用于闭壳层和开壳层 RHF。"

msgid ""
"The CAHF optimization with the quadratic or the SO-SCI optimization is "
"implemented into the CAHF program, and it can be called by ``{CAHF,SO;...}``"
" or ``{CAHF,SO-SCI;...}``."
msgstr ""
"具有二次或 SO-SCI 优化的 CAHF 优化已实现到 CAHF 程序中，可以通过 ``{CAHF,SO;…}`` 或 ``{CAHF,SO-"
"SCI;…}`` 调用。"

msgid ""
"A new variant of the SO-SCI optimization is available for the RHF case. It "
"optimizes all AVAS orbitals quadratically and is called by ``{RHF,SO-SCI-"
"ACTIVE}``."
msgstr ""
"SO-SCI 优化的一个新变体可用于 RHF 情况。它对所有 AVAS 轨道进行二次优化，并通过 ``{RHF,SO-SCI-ACTIVE}`` 调用。"

msgid ""
"The ``SO-SCI`` option significantly improves convergence and is recommended "
"in difficult cases. The cost may even be lower than for standard open-shell "
"RHF or CAHF calculations, since the number of iterations is reduced. "
"Furthermore, the probability of convergence to local minima or saddle points"
" is much reduced."
msgstr ""
"``SO-SCI`` 选项显著改善了收敛性，在困难情况下推荐使用。其计算成本甚至可能低于标准的开壳层 RHF 或 CAHF "
"计算，因为迭代次数减少了。此外，收敛到局部极小值或鞍点的概率也大大降低。"

msgid ""
"See section `options for the SO-SCI optimization "
"<the_scf_program.html#options-for-the-so-sci-optimization>`__ for more "
"details and options."
msgstr ""
"更多详情和选项，请参阅章节 `SO-SCI 优化的选项 <the_scf_program.html#optionsfortheso-"
"scioptimization>`__\\ 。"

msgid "MCSCF/CASSCF"
msgstr "MCSCF/CASSCF"

msgid ""
"The entire export of CI vectors to subsequent Molpro programs has been "
"rewritten. CI vectors can be exported via ``SAVE,CIREC=record`` or "
"``NATORB,orbrecord,CIREC=record``; more details can be found `here "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors>`__. All exported CI "
"vectors are stored in the CSFs basis. Determinants are automatically "
"transformed into the CSFs basis, which also allows an export with state-"
"averaging over different spins.  **Warning**: MULTI based CI records from "
"earlier Molpro versions are not compatible anymore, and the wfu file has to "
"be recalculated with Molpro 2022!"
msgstr ""
"向后续 Molpro 程序导出 CI 向量的整个流程已重写。CI 向量可通过 ``SAVE,CIREC=record`` 或 "
"``NATORB,orbrecord,CIREC=record`` 导出；更多详情可查看 `此处 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors>`__\\ 。所有导出的 CI 向量均以 "
"CSFs 基组存储。行列式会自动转换为 CSFs 基组，这也允许导出具有不同自旋态平均的向量。\\ **警告**\\ ：早期 Molpro 版本中基于 "
"MULTI 的 CI 记录不再兼容，wfu 文件必须使用 Molpro 2022 重新计算！"

msgid ""
"``{MULTI,CASCI;...}`` can now be simply called by ``{CASCI;...}``, and the "
"input orbitals are not transformed after the CASCI optimization (also for "
"dont,orbital)."
msgstr ""
"``{MULTI,CASCI;…}`` 现在可以简单地通过 ``{CASCI;…}`` 调用，并且在 CASCI 优化后输入轨道不会被转换（对于 "
"dont,orbital 也是如此）。"

msgid "Gradients of the state-averaged energy are now available."
msgstr "态平均能量的梯度现已可用。"

msgid ""
"The program is now more robust against spin-contamination in determinant "
"based calculations."
msgstr "该程序现在对基于行列式计算中的自旋污染更加稳健。"

msgid "MRCI, CASPT2"
msgstr "MRCI, CASPT2"

msgid ""
"The CI vectors stored in multi using the directive ``SAVE,CIREC=record`` can"
" now be used in the MRCI and CASPT2 programs as reference vectors using "
"option ``CIREC=record``."
msgstr ""
"现在，使用指令 ``SAVE,CIREC=record`` 存储在 multi 中的 CI 向量，可以通过选项 ``CIREC=record`` 在 "
"MRCI 和 CASPT2 程序中用作参考向量。"

msgid "MCSCF/CASSCF spin-orbit calculations (HLSMAT)"
msgstr "MCSCF/CASSCF 自旋轨道计算 (HLSMAT)"

msgid ""
"A new much more efficient algorithm for computing the spin-orbit Hamiltonian"
" using MCSCF wavefunctions and ECP spin-orbit operators. The program to "
"compute and diagonalize spin-orbit matrices can generally be called using"
msgstr ""
"一种新的、更高效的算法，用于使用 MCSCF 波函数和 ECP "
"自旋轨道算符计算自旋轨道哈密顿量。计算和对角化自旋轨道矩阵的程序通常可以通过以下方式调用："

msgid "``HLSMAT,type, record1, record2, record3, …``"
msgstr "``HLSMAT,type, record1, record2, record3, …``"

msgid ""
"where ``record1``, ``record2`` etc are records saved with MULTI or MRCI. The"
" new program is used if ``type`` is ``ECPLS`` and if no external excitations"
" are present (so either MCSCF/CASSCF wavefunctions or MRCI ones with NOEXC)."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``record1``\\ 、\\ ``record2`` 等是使用 MULTI 或 MRCI 保存的记录。如果 ``type`` 是 "
"``ECPLS`` 且不存在外部激发（因此是 MCSCF/CASSCF 波函数或带有 NOEXC 的 MRCI 波函数），则使用新程序。"

msgid ""
"For more details see section `spin-orbit-coupling#calculation and "
"diagonalization of the entire SO-matrix <spin-orbit-"
"coupling.html#calculation-and-diagonalization-of-the-entire-so-matrix>`__."
msgstr ""
"更多详细信息请参阅章节 `spin-orbit-coupling#calculation and diagonalization of the "
"entire SO-matrix <spin-orbit-coupling.html#calculation-and-diagonalization-"
"of-the-entire-so-matrix>`__\\ 。"

msgid "PNO-LCCSD"
msgstr "PNO-LCCSD"

msgid ""
"The IBO localization convergence threshold has been tightened from "
":math:`10^{-8}` to :math:`10^{-9}`. The PAO redundancy threshold ``THRLOC`` "
"has been tightened from :math:`10^{-6}` to :math:`10^{-7}`."
msgstr ""
"IBO 定域化的收敛阈值已从 :math:`10^{-8}` 收紧至 :math:`10^{-9}`\\ 。PAO 冗余阈值 ``THRLOC`` 已从"
" :math:`10^{-6}` 收紧至 :math:`10^{-7}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The localisation of core orbitals has been improved; it now uses an AO-based"
" algorithm, which minimises mixings of orbitals of different types (e.g. s, "
"p\\ :math:`_x`, p\\ :math:`_y`, p\\ :math:`_z`). It has been found that this"
" stabilises the F12(PNO) energy contribution if core orbitals are "
"correlated. The new default for core-orbital localization is "
"loc_method_core=IBO(AO)."
msgstr ""
"芯轨道的定域化已得到改进；它现在使用基于原子轨道的算法，该算法最小化了不同类型轨道（例如 s、p\\ :math:`_x`\\ 、p\\ "
":math:`_y`\\ 、p\\ :math:`_z`\\ ）的混合。已发现，如果芯轨道被关联，这可以稳定 F12(PNO) "
"能量贡献。芯轨道定域化的新默认值是 loc_method_core=IBO(AO)。"

msgid ""
"The previous behaviour of the PNO program can be recovered by putting before"
" the first PNO command:"
msgstr "通过在第一个 PNO 命令之前放置以下内容，可以恢复 PNO 程序的先前行为："

msgid "``local, thrpip=1.d-8, thrloc=1.d-6, loc_method_core=ibo``"
msgstr "``local, thrpip=1.d-8, thrloc=1.d-6, loc_method_core=ibo``"

msgid "The corresponding new options are"
msgstr "对应的新选项是"

msgid "``local, thrpip=1.d-9, thrloc=1.d-7, loc_method_core=ibo(ao)``"
msgstr "``local, thrpip=1.d-9, thrloc=1.d-7, loc_method_core=ibo(ao)``"

msgid "The options can also be given on the PNO command, lines."
msgstr "这些选项也可以在 PNO 命令行上给出。"

msgid "GUI gmolpro"
msgstr "GUI gmolpro"

msgid ""
"Version 1.4.0 of the graphical user interface gmolpro is compatible with "
"Molpro2022.1 ."
msgstr "图形用户界面 gmolpro 的 1.4.0 版本与 Molpro2022.1 兼容。"

msgid ""
"Main improvement over earlier versions is the ability to handle output files"
" (xml files) with several optimisations, frequency calculations, or even "
"different molecules within one xml file. Start from the brown window, open "
"the orbital window, and then select and load an orbital set. A corresponding"
" optimisation or vibrational modes may now be displayed."
msgstr ""
"相对于早期版本的主要改进是能够处理包含多个优化、频率计算甚至一个 xml 文件内不同分子的输出文件（xml "
"文件）。从棕色窗口开始，打开轨道窗口，然后选择并加载一个轨道集。现在可以显示相应的优化或振动模式。"

msgid ""
"When creating an input in guided mode, more properties may be selected by "
"buttons."
msgstr "在引导模式下创建输入时，可以通过按钮选择更多属性。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2021.2"
msgstr "MOLPRO2021.2 的新特性"

msgid "Parallel execution"
msgstr "并行执行"

msgid ""
"An option has been added to use MPI files instead of large GlobalArrays to "
"avoid potential GA allocation problems. From Molpro2020.2 the disk option "
"(``--ga-impl disk``) is the default for single-node calculations. Thus, GA "
"preallocation is not necessary unless ``--ga-impl ga`` is used. See `disk "
"option "
"<https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=running_molpro_on_parallel_computers#disk_option>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"新增了一个选项，使用 MPI 文件替代大型全局数组（GlobalArrays），以避免潜在的 GA 分配问题。从 Molpro2020.2 "
"开始，磁盘选项（\\ ``--ga-impl disk``\\ ）是单节点计算的默认设置。因此，除非使用 ``--ga-impl ga``\\ "
"，否则不需要进行 GA 预分配。详情请参阅 `磁盘选项 "
"<https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=running_molpro_on_parallel_computers#disk_option>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid ""
"For molpro2020.2 and Linux systems, an additional binary compiled with the "
"GA ``mpi-pr`` option is provided. It is recommended to use this binary if "
"``--ga-impl ga`` is chosen, since it avoids potential GA allocation problems"
" as well (the ``-G`` option is not needed). Note, however, that this "
"requires an extra helper process. For example, if ``-n 20`` is given, only "
"19 processes will be used for program execution. See `Running Molpro on "
"parallel computers "
"<https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=running_molpro_on_parallel_computers>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"对于 molpro2020.2 和 Linux 系统，提供了一个额外使用 GA ``mpi-pr`` 选项编译的二进制文件。如果选择了 ``--ga-"
"impl ga``\\ ，建议使用此二进制文件，因为它同样可以避免潜在的 GA 分配问题（不需要 ``-G`` "
"选项）。但请注意，这需要一个额外的辅助进程。例如，如果指定了 ``-n 20``\\ ，则只有 19 个进程会用于程序执行。详情请参阅 "
"`在并行计算机上运行 Molpro "
"<https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=running_molpro_on_parallel_computers>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid "RS2C/CASPT2"
msgstr "RS2C/CASPT2"

msgid ""
"Multi-state CASPT2 is now available in the rs2c program, see `Multi-State "
"CASPT2 <multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-"
"state-caspt2>`__."
msgstr ""
"多态 CASPT2 现在已在 rs2c 程序中可用，请参阅 `多态 CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-"
"statecaspt2>`__\\ 。"

msgid "NEVPT2"
msgstr "NEVPT2"

msgid ""
"NEVPT2 can now be done with density fitting, the command is ``DF-NEVPT2``"
msgstr "NEVPT2 现在可以使用密度拟合进行计算，命令为 ``DF-NEVPT2``"

msgid "AVAS"
msgstr "AVAS"

msgid ""
"Additional options allow a more flexible definition of the target space."
msgstr "新增选项允许更灵活地定义目标空间。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2021.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2021.1 的新特性"

msgid "Hartree-Fock"
msgstr "Hartree-Fock"

msgid ""
"A new implementation of the HF/KS program is now used by default. In "
"difficult cases this shows more robust convergence."
msgstr "现在默认使用新实现的 HF/KS 程序。在困难情况下，这显示出更稳健的收敛性。"

msgid ""
"Optionally, the hybrid second-order/super-ci method (so-sci) can be used in "
"difficult cases (hf,so-sci). In open-shell cases this converges more "
"robustly than the standard open-shell RHF procedure."
msgstr ""
"在困难情况下，可选择使用混合二阶/超 CI 方法（so-sci）（hf,so-sci）。在开壳层情况下，这比标准的开壳层 RHF 程序收敛更稳健。"

msgid ""
"`Generalized dynamical weighting <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#dynamical-"
"weighting>`__, in which the dynamical weighting can be restricted to certain"
" states."
msgstr ""
"`广义动态加权 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#dynamicalweighting>`__\\ "
"，其中动态加权可以限制在特定态。"

msgid ""
"`CAHF optimization <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cahf-optimization-with-the-"
"mcscf-program>`__ with the multi program for the state-averaged optimization"
" including all irreducible representations and spin manifolds. Convergence "
"is more robust than in the equivalent Hartree-Fock optimization, especially "
"for multiple CAHF shells."
msgstr ""
"使用 multi 程序进行 `CAHF 优化 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cahfoptimizationwiththemcscfprogram>`__\\ "
"，用于包含所有不可约表示和自旋流形的态平均优化。其收敛性比等效的 Hartree-Fock 优化更稳健，特别是对于多个 CAHF 壳层。"

msgid ""
"`RHF export <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#rhf-optimization-with-the-mcscf-"
"program>`__ for multi orbitals."
msgstr ""
"用于 multi 轨道的 `RHF 导出 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#rhfoptimizationwiththemcscfprogram>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"`State restrictions for one-electron properties. "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#matrix-elements-over-one-electron-"
"operators>`__"
msgstr ""
"`单电子性质的状态限制。 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#matrixelementsoverone-"
"electronoperators>`__"

msgid ""
"Export of the `raw orbitals <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raw-orbitals>`__ "
"used in the MCSCF optimization. Input orbitals stay untouched in combination"
" with the command dont,orbital."
msgstr ""
"导出 MCSCF 优化中使用的 `原始轨道 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#raworbitals>`__\\ "
"。输入轨道在与命令 dont,orbital 结合使用时保持不变。"

msgid "Analytical energy gradients"
msgstr "解析能量梯度"

msgid "Analytical energy gradients are now available for RASPT2 (using rs2)."
msgstr "解析能量梯度现已可用于 RASPT2（使用 rs2）。"

msgid "TD-DFT"
msgstr "TD-DFT"

msgid ""
"Rotatory strengths for simulating CD spectra of optically active molecules "
"can be computed for spin-restricted TDDFT excitations"
msgstr "用于模拟光学活性分子圆二色谱的旋光强度，现可为自旋限制的TDDFT激发进行计算"

msgid ""
"First-order nonadiabatic coupling matrix elements (NACME) are available for "
"closed and open-shell TDHF and TDDFT (LDA or GGA-type functionals)"
msgstr "一阶非绝热耦合矩阵元（NACME）现可用于闭壳层和开壳层的TDHF及TDDFT（LDA或GGA型泛函）"

msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "杂项"

msgid ""
"The sparse orbital print has been modified. Now it shows for each printed "
"coefficient the center number, the function type, and the sequence number "
"for this type at the given atom (denoted MU)."
msgstr "稀疏轨道打印已修改。现在，它为每个打印的系数显示中心编号、函数类型以及该类型在给定原子处的序列号（表示为MU）。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2020.2"
msgstr "MOLPRO2020.2的新特性"

msgid ""
"DF-MCSCF (single state), DF-HF, DF-UHF, DF-KS, and DF-UKS gradients are now "
"available with symmetry."
msgstr "DF-MCSCF（单态）、DF-HF、DF-UHF、DF-KS和DF-UKS的梯度现在可在对称性下使用。"

msgid ""
"TD-DFT gradients for closed-shell singlet excited states are available with "
"and without density fitting."
msgstr "闭壳层单重激发态的TD-DFT梯度现在可在有或没有密度拟合的情况下使用。"

msgid "PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12"

msgid ""
"The core orbitals are no longer excluded from the CCSD-F12 projector by "
"default. The approximation, which is applied by default in previous "
"versions, saves a few percent of the computation time, but can have a "
"significant effect in calculations involving transition metals. The old "
"default can be recovered by ``MODOMC=1``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，芯轨道不再从 CCSD-F12 "
"投影算符中排除。此近似在先前版本中默认启用，可节省约百分之几的计算时间，但在涉及过渡金属的计算中可能产生显著影响。可通过设置 ``MODOMC=1`` "
"恢复旧默认行为。"

msgid ""
"Correlated core orbitals are now localized separately from the valence "
"orbitals by default, which mostly improves the results and convergence in "
"calculations with core orbital correlation. The old default can be recovered"
" by ``LOC_OUTCORE=ON``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，相关芯轨道现在与价层轨道分开进行局域化，这主要改善了包含芯轨道相关计算的结果和收敛性。可通过设置 ``LOC_OUTCORE=ON`` "
"恢复旧默认行为。"

msgid ""
"The ``ENERGY`` variable is now set to a scalar representing the final energy"
" in F12 calculations. ``PNO-LCCSD-F12`` is now equivalent to ``PNO-"
"LCCSD-F12b``, and F12a and F12b total energies can be accessed from the "
"variables ``ENERGYA`` and ``ENERGYB``. Similar changes are made to the "
"``ENERGC`` variable."
msgstr ""
"``ENERGY`` 变量现在设置为表示 F12 计算最终能量的标量。\\ ``PNO-LCCSD-F12`` 现在等同于 ``PNO-"
"LCCSD-F12b``\\ ，F12a 和 F12b 的总能量可通过变量 ``ENERGYA`` 和 ``ENERGYB`` 获取。对 "
"``ENERGC`` 变量也进行了类似更改。"

msgid ""
"The scaling factor for F12-scaled triples now excludes the contribution from"
" distant pairs, for which F12 energies are neglected."
msgstr "F12 标度三重激发项的标度因子现在排除了远对的贡献，因为远对的 F12 能量被忽略。"

msgid "Linux binaries"
msgstr "Linux 二进制文件"

msgid ""
"The `minimum requirements <installation_guide.html#prerequisites>`__ for "
"using the Linux binaries has increased to glibc 2.17 or newer."
msgstr ""
"使用 Linux 二进制文件的\\ `最低要求 <installation_guide.html#prerequisites>`__ 已提高至 "
"glibc 2.17 或更新版本。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2020.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2020.1 的新功能"

msgid "Windows support"
msgstr "Windows 支持"

msgid "A windows beta version of Molpro is now available."
msgstr "Molpro 的 Windows 测试版现已可用。"

msgid "gMolpro: A graphical user interface"
msgstr "gMolpro：图形用户界面"

msgid ""
"A powerful graphical user interface (based on PQSMol) for building and "
"preoptimising molecular structures, preparing and running Molpro inputs, and"
" visualisation of results (will soon be available). gMolpro also supports "
"remote job submission and is available for Linux and Mac."
msgstr ""
"一个强大的图形用户界面（基于 PQSMol），用于构建和预优化分子结构、准备和运行 Molpro 输入文件以及结果可视化（即将推出）。gMolpro "
"还支持远程作业提交，适用于 Linux 和 Mac 系统。"

msgid "The MCSCF/CASSCF program MULTI"
msgstr "MCSCF/CASSCF 程序 MULTI"

msgid ""
"The CASSCF program multi has been largely rewritten and well parallelized. "
"Improved second-order algorithms as well as first-order methods applicable "
"to large molecules have been implemented. The new program combines robust "
"convergence with excellent efficiency. Details are described in `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5094644>`__ 150, 194106 (2019) and `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5142241>`__ 152, 074102 (2020)."
msgstr ""
"CASSCF 程序 multi "
"已进行了大规模重写并实现了良好的并行化。改进了适用于大分子的二阶算法以及一阶方法。新程序结合了稳健的收敛性和出色的效率。详细信息请参阅 `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5094644>`__ 150, 194106 (2019) 和 `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5142241>`__ 152, 074102 (2020)。"

msgid "Multi-state PNO-CASPT2"
msgstr "多态 PNO-CASPT2"

msgid ""
"The PNO-CASPT2 program for large molecules has been extended to allow multi-"
"state MS-CASPT2 calculations. For details see `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5097644>`__ 150, 214107 (2019)."
msgstr ""
"用于大分子的 PNO-CASPT2 程序已扩展，允许进行多态 MS-CASPT2 计算。详情请参阅 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.5097644>`__ 150, 214107 (2019)。"

msgid "Time-dependent density-functional (TDDFT) program"
msgstr "含时密度泛函 (TDDFT) 程序"

msgid "LibXC density functionals"
msgstr "LibXC 密度泛函"

msgid "Van-der-Waals density functionals"
msgstr "范德华密度泛函"

msgid ""
"An implementation of the nonlocal van-der-Waals DF VV10 by Vydrov & Van "
"Voorhis is available for spin-restriced wave functions to improve the "
"description of long-range correlation interactions of standard DFT methods."
msgstr ""
"Vydrov & Van Voorhis 的非局域范德华 DF VV10 实现可用于自旋限制波函数，以改进标准 DFT 方法对长程关联相互作用的描述。"

msgid ""
"Explicitly correlated local coupled-cluster program for high-spin open-shell"
" molecules"
msgstr "用于高自旋开壳层分子的显式相关局域耦合簇程序"

msgid "Extended potential energy surface generator"
msgstr "扩展的势能面生成器"

msgid "Acceleration of the POLY and the PESTRANS programs"
msgstr "POLY 和 PESTRANS 程序的加速"

msgid ""
"Due to a complete redesign of the programs for the fitting (POLY) and the "
"transformation of potential energy surfaces (PESTRANS), these programs could"
" be accelerated by several orders of magnitude (only operative in "
"combination of the new XSURF program)."
msgstr ""
"由于对势能面拟合（POLY）和变换（PESTRANS）程序进行了完全重新设计，这些程序的运行速度提高了数个数量级（仅在与新的XSURF程序结合使用时有效）。"

msgid "Electronic - vibrational spectra"
msgstr "电子-振动光谱"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2019.2"
msgstr "MOLPRO2019.2的新特性"

msgid "Improved parallel density fitting in Hartree-Fock and DFT"
msgstr "Hartree-Fock和DFT中改进的并行密度拟合"

msgid ""
"A new parallel density fitted Fock matrix generation has been implemented. "
"For large molecules this scales well across computer nodes (with a fast "
"network such as Infiniband) up to about half as many computing cores as "
"occupied orbitals."
msgstr ""
"已实现新的并行密度拟合 Fock 矩阵生成方法。对于大分子体系，该方法在计算节点间（使用如 Infiniband "
"等高速网络）具有良好的可扩展性，最多可扩展至约占据轨道数一半的计算核心数。"

msgid ""
"Symmetry can now be used in DF-HF and DF-KS (restricted and unrestricted), "
"but not yet for gradients."
msgstr "现在可在 DF-HF 和 DF-KS（限制性和非限制性）中使用对称性，但尚不支持梯度计算。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2018.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2018.1 的新特性"

msgid "Quasi-variational coupled-cluster (QVCCD)"
msgstr "准变分耦合簇 (QVCCD)"

msgid ""
"Improved efficient implementation of quasi-variational coupled-cluster "
"(QVCCD)."
msgstr "改进了准变分耦合簇 (QVCCD) 的高效实现。"

msgid "Analytical energy gradients for coupled cluster methods"
msgstr "耦合簇方法的解析能量梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytical energy gradients for closed shell DF-MP2-F12, DF-CCSD(T)-F12, "
"CCSD(T) and open-shell [DF-]RMP2 have been added. The gradients for "
"explicitly correlated (F12) methods are restricted to certain Ansätze; "
"please refer to the users manual for details and W. Györffy, G. Knizia and "
"H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5003065>`__ "
"**147**, 214101 (2017); W. Györffy and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436>`__ **148**, 114104 (2018)."
msgstr ""
"已为闭壳层 DF-MP2-F12、DF-CCSD(T)-F12、CCSD(T) 和开壳层 [DF-]RMP2 添加了解析能量梯度。显式相关 (F12) "
"方法的梯度仅限于某些拟设；详情请参阅用户手册以及 W. Györffy, G. Knizia 和 H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5003065>`__ **147**, 214101 (2017); W. "
"Györffy 和 H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5020436>`__ **148**, 114104 (2018)。"

msgid "Analytical energy gradients for projection-based WF-in-DFT embedding"
msgstr "投影式 WF-in-DFT 嵌入的解析能量梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytical nuclear gradients have been implemented for projection-based "
"wavefunction-in-DFT (WF-in-DFT) embedding with and without atomic orbital "
"(AO) truncation. The current available methods that can be used for the WF "
"method on subsystem A are CCSD(T), CCSD, MP2, and HF. The current available "
"methods that can be used for the low-level SCF method are LDA, LDAX (LDA "
"with any amount of exact exchange) and HF. The support for using GGAs as the"
" low-level method will be coming soon."
msgstr ""
"已实现基于投影的波函数嵌入DFT（WF-in-"
"DFT）的解析核梯度，支持含或不含原子轨道（AO）截断。当前可用于子系统A的WF方法有CCSD(T)、CCSD、MP2和HF。当前可用于低级别SCF方法的有LDA、LDAX（含任意比例精确交换的LDA）和HF。支持使用GGA作为低级别方法的功能即将推出。"

msgid "Analytical energy gradients for local methods"
msgstr "局域方法的解析能量梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytic energy gradients for local MP2, RMP2, CC2 and ADC(2) (with density "
"fitting) are available. These methods can be used for geometry optimisations"
" and property calculations of larger molecules."
msgstr "局域MP2、RMP2、CC2和ADC(2)（含密度拟合）的解析能量梯度现已可用。这些方法可用于较大分子的几何优化和性质计算。"

msgid "Local coupled cluster linear response method for ionization potentials"
msgstr "用于电离势的局域耦合簇线性响应方法"

msgid ""
"A hierarchy of local coupled cluster models for ionization potentials "
"employing LMP2 or LCC2 ground state amplitudes and the Jacobian formally "
"reaching the IP-CCSD level: IP-CCSD\\ :math:`_{\\rm CC2}` is now available. "
"For details see G. Wälz, D. Usvyat, T. Korona, M. Schütz, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4942234>`__ **144**, 084117 (2016)."
msgstr ""
"现已提供一套用于电离势的局域耦合簇模型层级，采用LMP2或LCC2基态振幅和雅可比矩阵，形式上达到IP-CCSD级别：IP-CCSD\\ "
":math:`_{\\rm CC2}` 现已可用。详情参见 G. Wälz, D. Usvyat, T. Korona, M. Schütz, `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4942234>`__ **144**, 084117 "
"(2016)。"

msgid "Local MP2 NMR shielding"
msgstr "局域MP2 NMR屏蔽"

msgid "Local MP2 NMR shielding, magnetisability, and rotational g tensors."
msgstr "局域MP2 NMR屏蔽、磁化率和旋转g张量。"

msgid "MR-CCSD(T)"
msgstr "MR-CCSD(T)"

msgid ""
"The internally contracted multi-reference program of A. Köhn et al. has been"
" interfaced to Molpro. An embedded Multireference Coupled Cluster method as "
"described in D. J. Coughtrie, R. Giereth, D. Kats, H.-J. Werner, and A. "
"Köhn, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b01144>`__ **14**, 693 (2018) is also "
"available."
msgstr ""
"A. Köhn 等人的内收缩多参考程序已与 Molpro 对接。如 D. J. Coughtrie, R. Giereth, D. Kats, "
"H.-J. Werner 和 A. Köhn 在 `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b01144>`__ **14**, 693 (2018) "
"中描述的嵌入式多参考耦合簇方法也已可用。"

msgid "Local density fitting Hartree-Fock and Kohn-Sham (LDF-HF, LDF-KS)"
msgstr "局域密度拟合 Hartree-Fock 和 Kohn-Sham (LDF-HF, LDF-KS)"

msgid ""
"A new parallel implementation of Hartree Fock with local density fitting "
"(closed and open-shell), as described in C. Köppl, H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. "
"Theory Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.6b00251>`__ **12**, 3122"
" (2016). This program can run in parallel across several nodes and is for "
"large systems significantly faster than canonical DF-HF, DF-KS."
msgstr ""
"如 C. Köppl, H.-J. Werner 在 `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.6b00251>`__ **12**, 3122 (2016) "
"中所述，Hartree Fock 与局域密度拟合（闭壳层和开壳层）的新并行实现。该程序可以在多个节点上并行运行，对于大体系，其速度显著快于传统的 DF-"
"HF 和 DF-KS。"

msgid ""
"Local complete active space second-order perturbation theory with pair "
"natural orbitals (PNO-CASPT2)"
msgstr "基于对自然轨道的局域完全活性空间二阶微扰理论 (PNO-CASPT2)"

msgid ""
"An accurate and efficient local PNO-CASPT2 for large molecules as described "
"in F. Menezes, D. Kats, H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4963019>`__ **145**, 124115 (2016). For "
"extended systems the computational effort scales linearly with molecular "
"size. A multi-state version will be made available soon."
msgstr ""
"如 F. Menezes, D. Kats, H.-J. Werner 在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4963019>`__ **145**, 124115 (2016) "
"中所述，一种用于大分子的精确且高效的局域 PNO-CASPT2 方法。对于扩展体系，其计算量随分子尺寸线性增长。多态版本将很快推出。"

msgid "D4 dispersion correction for DFT"
msgstr "用于 DFT 的 D4 色散校正"

msgid ""
"The new D4 dispersion model improves the description of atomic dispersion "
"coefficients through charge-dependent local polarisabilities obtained by a "
"self-consistent tight-binding method, see E. Caldeweyher, C. Bannwarth, and "
"S. Grimme `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4993215>`__ **147**,"
" 034112 (2017)"
msgstr ""
"新的 D4 色散模型通过自洽紧束缚方法获得的电荷依赖性局域极化率，改进了对原子色散系数的描述，参见 E. Caldeweyher, C. "
"Bannwarth 和 S. Grimme 的 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4993215>`__ **147**, 034112 (2017)。"

msgid "Nonlocal DFT method"
msgstr "非局域DFT方法"

msgid ""
"The nonlocal DFT method (NLDFT) improves the description of long-range "
"correlation interactions of standard DFT functionals through a double-"
"Hirshfeld partitioning of the correlation energy density, see A. Heßelmann, "
"`J. Chem. Theory Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct300735g>`__ **9**, "
"273 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"非局域DFT方法（NLDFT）通过相关能密度的双Hirshfeld分割，改进了标准DFT泛函对长程关联相互作用的描述，参见A. Heßelmann, "
"`J. Chem. Theory Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct300735g>`__ **9**, "
"273 (2013)。"

msgid "Kohn-Sham RPA methods"
msgstr "Kohn-Sham RPA方法"

msgid ""
"Random-phase approximation electron correlation methods based on Kohn-Sham "
"reference determinants, see Refs. A. Heßelmann, `Phys. Rev. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.85.012517>`__ **85**, 012517 (2012); A."
" Heßelmann and A. Görling, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct4007212>`__ **9**, 4382 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"基于Kohn-Sham参考行列式的随机相位近似电子相关方法，参见文献 A. Heßelmann, `Phys. Rev. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.85.012517>`__ **85**, 012517 (2012); A."
" Heßelmann and A. Görling, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct4007212>`__ **9**, 4382 (2013)。"

msgid "New features in DFT-SAPT"
msgstr "DFT-SAPT中的新功能"

msgid ""
"Several new features have been implemented in the DFT-SAPT program, "
"including:"
msgstr "DFT-SAPT程序中已实现多项新功能，包括："

msgid ""
"Exchange interaction energy contributions without the single-exchange "
"approximation (R. Schäffer and G. Jansen,  *Theor. Chem. Acc.* **131** "
"(2012) 1235; `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2013.827253>`__ **111**, 2570 (2013))"
msgstr ""
"无单交换近似的交换相互作用能贡献（R. Schäffer and G. Jansen, *Theor. Chem. Acc.* **131** "
"(2012) 1235; `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2013.827253>`__ **111**, 2570 (2013)）"

msgid ""
"DFT-SAPT employing exact-exchange response kernels (A. Heßelmann, `J. Chem. "
"Theory Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b01233>`__ **14**, 1943"
" (2018))"
msgstr ""
"采用精确交换响应核的DFT-SAPT（A. Heßelmann, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b01233>`__ **14**, 1943 (2018)）"

msgid ""
"Regularised SAPT for estimating short-range polarisation interactions (A. J."
" Misquitta, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400704a>`__ **9**, 5313 (2013))"
msgstr ""
"用于估计短程极化相互作用的正则化SAPT（A. J. Misquitta, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400704a>`__ **9**, 5313 (2013)）"

msgid "Automated selection of molecular active space (AVAS)"
msgstr "分子活性空间的自动选择（AVAS）"

msgid ""
"This method helps to find good starting orbitals for CASSCF calculations. It"
" is based on the work of Knizia et al., `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b00128>`__ **13**, 4063 (2017)."
msgstr ""
"该方法有助于为CASSCF计算找到良好的初始轨道。它基于Knizia等人的工作，\\ `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b00128>`__ **13**, 4063 (2017)。"

msgid "Further enhancements"
msgstr "进一步的增强"

msgid "Improved parallelization of coupled-cluster codes"
msgstr "改进的耦合簇代码并行化"

msgid "Improved DFT quadrature"
msgstr "改进的DFT求积"

msgid ""
"New plugin interfaces for other programs, e.g. MR-CCSD(T), DMRG and FCIQMC "
"codes, supporting directed parallel execution"
msgstr "用于其他程序的新插件接口，例如MR-CCSD(T)、DMRG和FCIQMC代码，支持定向并行执行"

msgid ""
"Implementation of the eXact-2-Component (X2C) scalar relativistic "
"Hamilitonian"
msgstr "精确二分量（X2C）标量相对论哈密顿量的实现"

msgid "Support for a Gaussian finite nucleus model"
msgstr "支持高斯有限核模型"

msgid ""
"New correlation consistent basis sets for heavy alkali and alkaline earth "
"elements (both relativistic all-electron and with ECPs), as well as all-"
"electron (DK3 and X2C) basis sets for the lanthanide and actinide elements."
msgstr "为重碱金属和碱土金属元素新增了相关一致基组（包括相对论全电子基组和带ECP的基组），以及镧系和锕系元素的全电子（DK3和X2C）基组。"

msgid ""
"X2C-contracted versions for all the standard correlation consistent basis "
"sets for H, He, B-Ne, and Al-Cl, e.g., cc-pVDZ-X2C"
msgstr "为H、He、B-Ne和Al-Cl的所有标准相关一致基组提供了X2C收缩版本，例如cc-pVDZ-X2C。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2015.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2015.1的新特性"

msgid ""
"Molpro 2015 contains many improvements, bug-fixes and new features. Only the"
" most important ones are listed in the following."
msgstr "Molpro 2015包含许多改进、错误修复和新特性。以下仅列出最重要的部分。"

msgid "Projection-based wavefunction-in-DFT embedding"
msgstr "基于投影的波函数嵌入DFT方法"

msgid "Intrinsic bond-orbital analysis and orbital localization (IBO)."
msgstr "本征键轨道分析和轨道定域化（IBO）。"

msgid ""
"IBOs provide a reliable and efficient way to generate localized orbitals and"
" to analyze wavefunctions, see G. Knizia, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400687b>`__ **9**, 4834 (2013)"
msgstr ""
"IBO 提供了一种可靠且高效的方法来生成定域轨道并分析波函数，参见 G. Knizia, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct400687b>`__ **9**, 4834 (2013)"

msgid "Interface to NBO6"
msgstr "与 NBO6 的接口"

msgid ""
"Molpro 2015 supports NBO6 Natural Bond Orbital Analysis (NBO6) via an "
"interface. NBO6 must be licensed separately."
msgstr "Molpro 2015 通过一个接口支持 NBO6 自然键轨道分析 (NBO6)。NBO6 必须单独获得许可。"

msgid ""
"Beyond LMP2 treatment of intermolecular pairs in local coupled cluster "
"methods"
msgstr "局域耦合簇方法中分子间对的超越 LMP2 处理"

msgid ""
"Usually close (and weak) pairs are treated only at the LMP2 level in "
"LCCSD(T) calculations. This not satisfying since LMP2 often treats van der "
"Waals interactions poorly, hence compromising the high accuracy of the "
"actual LCCSD(T) calculation. Fortunately, close pairs can now be treated in "
"an inexpensive way at a level beyond LMP2, ranging from local direct RPA "
"*via* ring CCD to LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}`. This is described in"
msgstr ""
"在 LCCSD(T) 计算中，通常近对（和弱对）仅在 LMP2 级别处理。这并不令人满意，因为 LMP2 "
"通常对范德华相互作用的处理效果不佳，从而影响了实际 LCCSD(T) 计算的高精度。幸运的是，现在可以以超越 LMP2 "
"的级别，以经济的方式处理近对，范围从局域直接 RPA *经由* 环状 CCD 到 LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}`\\ "
"。这在以下文献中有所描述："

msgid "Distinguishable cluster Approximation (DCSD and DCSD-F12)"
msgstr "可区分簇近似 (DCSD 和 DCSD-F12)"

msgid ""
"This approximation yields improved results at the cost of CCSD. In "
"particular, DCSD equilibrium structures are as accurate as for CCSD(T), see"
msgstr "该近似方法以 CCSD 为代价获得了改进的结果。特别是，DCSD 平衡结构的精度与 CCSD(T) 相当，参见"

msgid ""
"Analytical gradients are now available for DCSD. Analytical gradients for "
"CCSD(T), as well as for MP2-F12, CCSD(T)-F12, and DCSD-F12 are under "
"development and will be made available free of charge at a later stage."
msgstr ""
"DCSD 的解析梯度现已可用。CCSD(T) 以及 MP2-F12、CCSD(T)-F12 和 DCSD-F12 "
"的解析梯度正在开发中，将在后续阶段免费提供。"

msgid ""
"Orbital relaxed properties and analytical nuclear gradients for excited "
"states"
msgstr "激发态的轨道弛豫性质和解析核梯度"

msgid ""
"Orbital relaxed properties, and analytical nuclear gradients for excited "
"states are now available for local CC2 response and local ADC(2). This "
"allows for geometry optimizations of excited states of large chromophores at"
" these levels of theory. Furthermore, also local ADC(2) transition moments "
"at the level of strict ADC(2) (which require second-order ground state "
"singles and doubles) are available. For further reference see"
msgstr ""
"局域 CC2 响应和局域 ADC(2) "
"的轨道弛豫性质以及激发态的解析核梯度现已可用。这使得在这些理论水平上对大发色团的激发态进行几何优化成为可能。此外，严格 ADC(2) "
"水平（需要二阶基态单双激发）的局域 ADC(2) 跃迁矩也已可用。更多参考文献请参见"

msgid "PNO-LMP2 and PNO-LMP2-F12"
msgstr "PNO-LMP2 和 PNO-LMP2-F12"

msgid ""
"New parallel linear scaling PNO-LMP2 and PNO-LMP2-F12 programs as described "
"in"
msgstr "新的并行线性标度 PNO-LMP2 和 PNO-LMP2-F12 程序，如以下文献所述"

msgid ""
"are available in version 2015. PNO-LCCSD(T) is currently under development "
"and will be made freely available to licensees of Molpro 2015 at a later "
"stage."
msgstr "已在 2015 版本中提供。PNO-LCCSD(T) 目前正在开发中，将在稍后阶段免费提供给 Molpro 2015 的许可用户。"

msgid "Magnetizability and rotational g-tensor at DF-LMP2 level using GIAOs"
msgstr "使用GIAO在DF-LMP2级别计算磁化率和转动g张量"

msgid ""
"The program for NMR chemical shifts has been extended to include also "
"magnetizability and rotational g-tensor. This is described in"
msgstr "NMR化学位移计算程序已扩展至包含磁化率和转动g张量。相关描述见"

msgid "Faster density fitting integral routines"
msgstr "更快的密度拟合积分程序"

msgid ""
"DFT and F12 methods with density fitting are significantly speeded up using "
"improved integration routines written by G. Knizia."
msgstr "采用G. Knizia编写的改进积分程序，显著提升了密度拟合下的DFT和F12方法计算速度。"

msgid "Vibrational perturbation theory: VPT2"
msgstr "振动微扰理论：VPT2"

msgid ""
"A VPT2 program based on a semi-quartic force field (QFF) has been "
"implemented, which allows for low-cost evaluations of anharmonic vibrational"
" frequencies and associated vibrational constants. The determination of the "
"QFF does not require analytical gradients (see the ``SURF`` program) and can"
" thus been used in combination with any electronic structure method."
msgstr ""
"现已实现基于半四次力场（QFF）的VPT2程序，可低成本评估非谐振动频率及相关振动常数。QFF的确定无需解析梯度（参见\\ ``SURF``\\ "
"程序），因此可与任何电子结构方法结合使用。"

msgid "Vibrational multi-reference methods: VMCSCF, VMRCI"
msgstr "振动多参考方法：VMCSCF, VMRCI"

msgid ""
"A suite of vibrational multi-reference methods is available now. Modals can "
"be optimized at the VMCSCF level [S. Heislbetz and G. Rauhut, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3364861>`__ **132**, 124102 (2012)] and "
"correlation effects can be accounted for either variationally (VMRCI [F. "
"Pfeiffer and G. Rauhut, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4865098>`__ **140**, 064110 (2014)]."
msgstr ""
"现已提供一套振动多参考方法。模态可在 VMCSCF 级别进行优化 [S. Heislbetz and G. Rauhut, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3364861>`__ **132**, 124102 "
"(2012)]，并且相关效应可以通过变分法（VMRCI [F. Pfeiffer and G. Rauhut, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4865098>`__ **140**, 064110 (2014)]）加以考虑。"

msgid "Anharmonic Franck-Condon factors: FCON"
msgstr "非谐弗兰克-康登因子：FCON"

msgid ""
"Transformation of multi-dimensional potential energy surfaces: PESTRANS"
msgstr "多维势能面的变换：PESTRANS"

msgid ""
"Multi-dimensional potential energy surfaces spanned in terms of normal "
"coordinates - as computed with the ``SURF`` program - can now be rotated or "
"transformed into an arbitrary set of normal coordinates. This allows for the"
" efficient calculation of Franck-Condon factors or the calculation of "
"vibrational spectra of isotopologues from just one potential energy surface "
"[P. Meier, D. Oschetzki, R. Berger and G. Rauhut, J. Chem. Phys. **140**, "
"184111 (2014)]."
msgstr ""
"以简正坐标表示的多维势能面——如使用 ``SURF`` 程序计算所得——现在可以旋转或变换为任意一组简正坐标。这使得能够高效计算弗兰克-"
"康登因子，或仅从一个势能面计算同位素体的振动光谱 [P. Meier, D. Oschetzki, R. Berger and G. Rauhut, "
"J. Chem. Phys. **140**, 184111 (2014)]。"

msgid "Localized normal coordinates"
msgstr "局域简正坐标"

msgid ""
"Within the ``SURF`` program, multi-dimensional potential energy surfaces can"
" now alternatively be spanned in terms of localized normal coordinates. "
"Three localization schemes are offered: (a) localization of the CH-"
"stretching modes only and (b) localization of all normal coordinates to the "
"subunits in molecular cluster calculations or (c) both. All localization "
"schemes are symmetry sensitive."
msgstr ""
"在 ``SURF`` 程序中，多维势能面现在也可以选择用局域简正坐标来表示。提供了三种局域化方案：(a) 仅局域化 CH 伸缩模式，(b) "
"在分子团簇计算中将所有简正坐标局域化到子单元，或 (c) 两者兼有。所有局域化方案都对对称性敏感。"

msgid "Calculation of arbitrary vibrational states: VIBSTATE"
msgstr "任意振动态的计算：VIBSTATE"

msgid ""
"In the old Molpro release the calculation of vibrational states was limited "
"to fundamentals, first vibrational overtones and simple combination bands. "
"The new ``VIBSTATE`` program allows to specify arbitrary vibrational states,"
" but the user must take care, that the parameters in the ``SURF`` program "
"and the vibrational correlation programs are adjusted accordingly."
msgstr ""
"在旧版Molpro中，振动态的计算仅限于基频、第一振动泛音和简单的组合带。新的 ``VIBSTATE`` "
"程序允许指定任意的振动态，但用户必须注意，需相应调整 ``SURF`` 程序和振动关联程序中的参数。"

msgid "Raman scattering activities"
msgstr "拉曼散射活性"

msgid ""
"Raman scattering activities can now be computed within all vibrational SCF "
"and vibration correlation programs. As polarizabilities can only be "
"determined at the Hartree-Fock level, the accuracy is currently still "
"limited."
msgstr "现在可以在所有振动SCF和振动关联程序中计算拉曼散射活性。由于极化率只能在Hartree-Fock级别确定，因此目前精度仍然有限。"

msgid "Reaction databases"
msgstr "反应数据库"

msgid ""
"A facility is provided to store and interrogate sets of molecules, together "
"with information about how they are to be combined in balanced chemical "
"equations. This database can be generated manually, or partially by running "
"appropriate Molpro calculations. Analysis of the database can give a summary"
" of the energy changes associated with each described reaction, and two or "
"more similar databases can be compared reaction by reaction, to give a "
"statistical analysis of the differences between them. Several common "
"databases are included."
msgstr ""
"提供了一个设施来存储和查询分子集合，以及关于如何在配平化学方程式中组合它们的信息。该数据库可以手动生成，或通过运行适当的Molpro计算部分生成。分析数据库可以给出每个描述反应相关的能量变化摘要，并且可以逐个反应地比较两个或更多个相似的数据库，以提供它们之间差异的统计分析。包含了一些常见的数据库。"

msgid "New density-fitting DFT-SAPT program"
msgstr "新的密度拟合DFT-SAPT程序"

msgid ""
"A new DFT-SAPT program has been implemented in Molpro which can be used in "
"conjunction with monomer-centered (MCBS), monomer-centered plus (MC+BS) or "
"dimer-centered (DCBS) basis sets. Even in DCBS mode fairly large complexes "
"with about 800 electrons can be studied with this program, see A. Heßelmann "
"and T. Korona. `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4893990>`__ "
"**141**, 094107 (2014)."
msgstr ""
"Molpro中实现了一个新的DFT-"
"SAPT程序，可与单体中心（MCBS）、单体中心加（MC+BS）或二聚体中心（DCBS）基组结合使用。即使在DCBS模式下，该程序也可以研究具有约800个电子的相当大的复合物，参见A."
" Heßelmann和T. Korona。\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4893990>`__ **141**, 094107 (2014)。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2012.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2012.1的新特性"

msgid ""
"A summary of the features in Molpro can be found in a recent review: H.-J. "
"Werner, P. J. Knowles, G. Knizia, F. R. Manby, and M. Schütz, *Molpro – a "
"general purpose quantum chemistry program package*, WIRES Comput. Mol. Sci. "
"**2**, 242 (2012), `10.1002/wcms.82 <https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/wcms.82>`__."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 功能的概述可在一篇近期综述中找到：H.-J. Werner, P. J. Knowles, G. Knizia, F. R. Manby,"
" and M. Schütz, *Molpro – a general purpose quantum chemistry program "
"package*, WIRES Comput. Mol. Sci. **2**, 242 (2012), `10.1002/wcms.82 "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/wcms.82>`__."

msgid "The new features of Molpro version 2012.1 include the following."
msgstr "Molpro 版本 2012.1 的新功能包括以下内容。"

msgid "Quasi-variational coupled-cluster theory"
msgstr "准变分耦合簇理论"

msgid ""
"This modification of standard CCSD is capable of robustly describing "
"chemical bond breaking with a single Hartree-Fock reference determinant (see"
" J. B. Robinson and P. J. Knowles, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3680560>`__ **136**, 054114 (2012), "
"`10.1063/1.3680560 <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3680560>`__). It is "
"implemented for closed-shell systems, with either the Brueckner condition or"
" energy optimisation for the determination of orbitals. Triple excitations "
"can be included perturbatively, ``BQVCCD(T)`` or ``OQVCCD(T)`` (J. B. "
"Robinson and P. J. Knowles, `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C2CP40698E>`__ **14**, 6729-6732 (2012), "
"`10.1039/C2CP40698E <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C2CP40698E>`__; J. Chem. "
"Theor. Comput. **8**, 2653-2660 (2012), `10.1021/ct300416b "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct300416b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"这种对标准 CCSD 的修改能够稳健地描述使用单个 Hartree-Fock 参考行列式的化学键断裂（参见 J. B. Robinson and P. "
"J. Knowles, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3680560>`__ "
"**136**, 054114 (2012), `10.1063/1.3680560 "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3680560>`__\\ ）。它针对闭壳层体系实现，轨道确定可采用 Brueckner "
"条件或能量优化。三重激发可以微扰方式包含，即 ``BQVCCD(T)`` 或 ``OQVCCD(T)``\\ （J. B. Robinson and "
"P. J. Knowles, `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C2CP40698E>`__ **14**, 6729-6732 (2012), "
"`10.1039/C2CP40698E <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C2CP40698E>`__; J. Chem. "
"Theor. Comput. **8**, 2653-2660 (2012), `10.1021/ct300416b "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct300416b>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "A new internally contracted MRCI code: MRCIC"
msgstr "一个新的内收缩 MRCI 代码：MRCIC"

msgid ""
"A new internally contracted MRCI code [see K. R. Shamasundar, G. Knizia, and"
" H.-J. Werner, *A new internally contracted multi-reference configuration "
"interaction (MRCI) method*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3609809>`__ **135**, 054101 (2011)] is now "
"available. As compared to the old MRCI code it has the following advantages:"
" (i) inactive orbitals (correlated in MRCI but closed-shell in the reference"
" function) are treated explicitly, i.e., no density matrices and coupling "
"coefficients need to be computed that involve these orbitals. Thus, in "
"principle any number of inactive orbitals can be correlated, without the "
"previously existing limitation to 32 correlated orbitals. Furthermore, "
"additional configuration spaces are internally contracted (as in the RS2C "
"code), resulting in a much improved efficiency, particularly for cases with "
"many inactive orbitals. Currently, the method is implemented only for "
"single-state calculations, but an extension to multi-state cases is under "
"development and will be provided in the near future."
msgstr ""
"一个新的内收缩 MRCI 代码 [参见 K. R. Shamasundar, G. Knizia, and H.-J. Werner, *A new "
"internally contracted multi-reference configuration interaction (MRCI) "
"method*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3609809>`__ **135**, "
"054101 (2011)] 现已可用。与旧的 MRCI 代码相比，它具有以下优势：(i) 非活性轨道（在 MRCI "
"中相关但在参考函数中为闭壳层）被显式处理，即，无需计算涉及这些轨道的密度矩阵和耦合系数。因此，原则上可以关联任意数量的非活性轨道，而不再受先前存在的 "
"32 个关联轨道的限制。此外，额外的组态空间是内收缩的（如同在 RS2C "
"代码中），从而显著提高了效率，特别是在具有许多非活性轨道的情况下。目前，该方法仅针对单态计算实现，但对多态情况的扩展正在开发中，并将在不久的将来提供。"

msgid "Explicitly correlated multireference theories: RS2-F12, MRCI-F12"
msgstr "显式相关多参考理论：RS2-F12, MRCI-F12"

msgid ""
"Explicitly correlated multireference theories (CASPT2-F12, MRCI-F12) as "
"described in T. Shiozaki and H.-J. Werner, *Communication: Second-order "
"multireference perturbation theory with explicit correlation: CASPT2-F12*, "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ **133**, 141103 "
"(2010); T. Shiozaki, G. Knizia, and H.-J. Werner, *Explicitly correlated "
"multireference configuration interaction: MRCI-F12*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3528720>`__ **134**, 034113 (2011); T. "
"Shiozaki and H.-J. Werner, *Explicitly correlated multireference "
"configuration interaction with multiple reference functions: Avoided "
"crossings and conical intersections*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3587632>`__ **134**, 184104 (2011) lead to "
"much improved convergence of the correlation energies with the basis set "
"size. Explicitly correlated version of the RS2C and MRCIC codes are not yet "
"available but will be made available as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"显式相关多参考理论（CASPT2-F12, MRCI-F12）如 T. Shiozaki and H.-J. Werner, "
"*Communication: Second-order multireference perturbation theory with "
"explicit correlation: CASPT2-F12*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ **133**, 141103 (2010); T. "
"Shiozaki, G. Knizia, and H.-J. Werner, *Explicitly correlated multireference"
" configuration interaction: MRCI-F12*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3528720>`__ **134**, 034113 (2011); T. "
"Shiozaki and H.-J. Werner, *Explicitly correlated multireference "
"configuration interaction with multiple reference functions: Avoided "
"crossings and conical intersections*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3587632>`__ **134**, 184104 (2011) "
"中所述，显著改善了相关能随基组大小的收敛性。RS2C 和 MRCIC 代码的显式相关版本尚不可用，但将尽快提供。"

msgid ""
"A review of the explicitly correlated multireference methods can be found in"
" T. Shiozaki and H.-J. Werner, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2013.779393>`__ **111**, 607 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"关于显式相关多参考方法的综述可参见 T. Shiozaki 和 H.-J. Werner 的论文，\\ `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2013.779393>`__ **111**, 607 (2013)。"

msgid "Extended multi-state CASPT2"
msgstr "扩展多态 CASPT2"

msgid ""
"Extended multistate CASPT2 (XMS-CASPT2) [see T. Shiozaki, W. Győrffy, P. "
"Celani, and H.-J. Werner, *Communication: The extended multi-state CASPT2 "
"method: Energy and nuclear gradients*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3633329>`__ **135**, 081106 (2011)] provides a"
" better description of near degenerate situations and avoided crossings. "
"Currently this option is available only with the ``RS2`` code, not for "
"``RS2C``."
msgstr ""
"扩展多态 CASPT2 (XMS-CASPT2) [参见 T. Shiozaki, W. Győrffy, P. Celani 和 H.-J. "
"Werner 的论文，\\ *Communication: The extended multi-state CASPT2 method: Energy"
" and nuclear gradients*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3633329>`__ **135**, 081106 (2011)] "
"能更好地描述近简并情况和避免交叉。目前此选项仅适用于 ``RS2`` 代码，不适用于 ``RS2C``\\ 。"

msgid "Density fitted CASSCF and CASPT2"
msgstr "密度拟合 CASSCF 和 CASPT2"

msgid ""
"CASSCF and CASPT2 as well as the corresponding analytical gradient theories "
"are now available with density fitting (``DF-CASSCF``, ``DF-RS2``). See "
"details in W. Győrffy, T. Shiozaki, G. Knizia, and H.-J. Werner, *Analytical"
" energy gradients for second-order multireference perturbation theory using "
"density fitting*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4793737>`__ "
"**138**, 104104 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"CASSCF 和 CASPT2 以及相应的解析梯度理论现已支持密度拟合 (``DF-CASSCF``, ``DF-RS2``)。详情参见 W. "
"Győrffy, T. Shiozaki, G. Knizia 和 H.-J. Werner 的论文，\\ *Analytical energy "
"gradients for second-order multireference perturbation theory using density "
"fitting*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4793737>`__ **138**,"
" 104104 (2013)。"

msgid "Extensions of explicitly correlated coupled-cluster methods"
msgstr "显式相关耦合簇方法的扩展"

msgid ""
"Further basis sets of K. A. Peterson and J.G. Hill for explicitly correlated"
" methods have been included. In particular these include the aug-cc-pVnZ-"
"PP/OptRI and aug-cc-pwCVnZ-PP/OptRI sets for the group 11 and 12 transition "
"metals. A full set of F12 basis sets for the :math:`p`-block elements Ga-Rn "
"will be added in the very near future. For recent work on molecules "
"containing transition metals see D. H. Bross, J. G. Hill, H.-J. Werner, and "
"Kirk A. Peterson, *Explicitly correlated composite thermochemistry of "
"transition metal species*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4818725>`__ **139**, 094302 (2013)."
msgstr ""
"K. A. Peterson 和 J.G. Hill 为显式相关方法开发的更多基组已被纳入。特别是包括了针对第 11 和 12 族过渡金属的 aug-"
"cc-pVnZ-PP/OptRI 和 aug-cc-pwCVnZ-PP/OptRI 基组。一套完整的用于 :math:`p` 区元素 Ga-Rn 的 "
"F12 基组将在近期添加。关于含过渡金属分子的近期工作，参见 D. H. Bross, J. G. Hill, H.-J. Werner 和 Kirk "
"A. Peterson 的论文，\\ *Explicitly correlated composite thermochemistry of "
"transition metal species*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4818725>`__ **139**, 094302 (2013)。"

msgid ""
"Density fitted local coupled-cluster methods: DF-LCCSD(T), DF-LUCCSD(T), DF-"
"LRPA"
msgstr "密度拟合局域耦合簇方法：DF-LCCSD(T)、DF-LUCCSD(T)、DF-LRPA"

msgid ""
"The local coupled cluster methods have been further improved. See H.-J. "
"Werner and M. Schütz, *An efficient local coupled-cluster method for "
"accurate thermochemistry of large systems*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3641642>`__ **135**, 144116 (2011) for a "
"description of the current implementation. An open-shell implementation [DF-"
"LUCCSD(T)] is now also available (Y. Liu and H.-J. Werner, to be published.)"
" Furthermore, the direct random phase approximation (RPA) has been "
"implemented as a local method and using density fitting. Direct RPA can be "
"considered as a CCD method reduced to only ring diagrams. In contrast tp MP2"
" it also contains higher-order diagrams which e.g. cover Axilrod-Teller "
"terms in intermolecular calculations. It is therefore especially attractive "
"to replace in LCC calculations the LMP2 method for weak pairs by LRPA. This "
"is now possible in our LCC code (O. Masur and M. Schütz, to be published.)"
msgstr ""
"局域耦合簇方法已得到进一步改进。关于当前实现的描述，请参见 H.-J. Werner 和 M. Schütz "
"的论文《一种用于大体系精确热化学的高效局域耦合簇方法》，\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3641642>`__ **135**, 144116 (2011)。开壳层实现 [DF-"
"LUCCSD(T)] 现已可用（Y. Liu 和 H.-J. Werner，待发表）。此外，直接随机相位近似 (RPA) "
"已实现为一种局域方法并使用密度拟合。直接 RPA 可被视为仅保留环图的 CCD 方法。与 MP2 相比，它还包含更高阶的图，例如在分子间计算中涵盖 "
"Axilrod-Teller 项。因此，在 LCC 计算中用 LRPA 替代弱对的 LMP2 方法尤其具有吸引力。这现在在我们的 LCC "
"代码中已成为可能（O. Masur 和 M. Schütz，待发表）。"

msgid ""
"Local coupled-cluster methods with orbital-specific virtual orbitals: OSV-"
"LCCSD(T)"
msgstr "使用轨道特定虚轨道的局域耦合簇方法：OSV-LCCSD(T)"

msgid ""
"Explicitly correlated local MP2 and CC methods: DF-LMP2-F12, DF-LCCSD(T)-F12"
msgstr "显式相关局域 MP2 和 CC 方法：DF-LMP2-F12、DF-LCCSD(T)-F12"

msgid ""
"The explicitly correlated coupled cluster methods as described in H.-J. "
"Werner, *Eliminating the domain error in local explicitly correlated second-"
"order Møller-Plesset perturbation theory*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2982419>`__ **129**, 101103 (2008); T. B. "
"Adler, F. R. Manby, and H.-J. Werner, *Local explicitly correlated second-"
"order perturbation theory for the accurate treatment of large molecules*, "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3040174>`__ **130**, 054106 "
"(2009); T. B. Adler and H.-J. Werner, *Local explicitly correlated coupled-"
"cluster methods: Efficient removal of the basis set incompleteness and "
"domain errors*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3160675>`__ "
"**130**, 241101 (2009); T. B. Adler and H.-J. Werner, *An explicitly "
"correlated local coupled-cluster method for calculations of large molecules "
"close to the basis set limit*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3647565>`__ **135**, 144117 (2011) are "
"available for closed-shell cases (an open-shell implementation will follow "
"soon). In these methods the errors of the local domain approximation are "
"eliminated to a large extend, and the same accuracy as with the "
"corresponding canonical methods can be achieved, even for molecules with "
"50-100 atoms."
msgstr ""
"H.-J. Werner 在《消除局域显式相关二阶 Møller-Plesset 微扰理论中的域误差》\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2982419>`__ **129**, 101103 (2008)；T. B. "
"Adler, F. R. Manby 和 H.-J. Werner 在《用于精确处理大分子的局域显式相关二阶微扰理论》\\ `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3040174>`__ **130**, 054106 (2009)；T. B."
" Adler 和 H.-J. Werner 在《局域显式相关耦合簇方法：高效消除基组不完备性和域误差》\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3160675>`__ **130**, 241101 (2009)；以及 T. B. "
"Adler 和 H.-J. Werner 在《一种用于接近基组极限的大分子计算的显式相关局域耦合簇方法》\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3647565>`__ **135**, 144117 (2011) "
"中描述的显式相关耦合簇方法现已可用于闭壳层情况（开壳层实现将很快跟进）。在这些方法中，局域域近似的误差在很大程度上被消除，即使对于含有 50-100 "
"个原子的分子，也能达到与相应正则方法相同的精度。"

msgid "Improved DFT with density fitting"
msgstr "使用密度拟合改进的 DFT"

msgid ""
"The efficiency of density functional theory has been much improved. In "
"particular, the density fitting (DF-RKS, DF-UKS) codes for analytical energy"
" gradients are now very much faster, due to a new integral code (adaptive "
"integral core, AIC) written by G. Knizia. Some benchmarks can be found in "
"H.-J. Werner, P. J. Knowles, G. Knizia, F. R. Manby, and M. Schütz, *Molpro "
"– a general purpose quantum chemistry program package*, WIRES Comput. Mol. "
"Sci. **2**, 242 (2012)."
msgstr ""
"密度泛函理论的效率已得到极大提升。特别是，由于 G. Knizia 编写的新积分代码（自适应积分核心，AIC），用于解析能量梯度的密度拟合 (DF-"
"RKS, DF-UKS) 代码现在速度要快得多。一些基准测试可在 H.-J. Werner, P. J. Knowles, G. Knizia, F. "
"R. Manby 和 M. Schütz 的论文《Molpro – 一个通用量子化学程序包》WIRES Comput. Mol. Sci. **2**,"
" 242 (2012) 中找到。"

msgid "Additional density functionals"
msgstr "新增密度泛函"

msgid ""
"A large number of additional density functionals has been added, including "
"PBE0, PBEREV, M05, M05-2X, M06, M06-2X, M06-L, M06-HF, M08-HX, M08-SO, "
"M11-L, SOGGA, SOGGA11, SOGGA11-X. (M11 is currently not available, but will "
"likely be added in the near future)."
msgstr ""
"已添加大量额外的密度泛函，包括 "
"PBE0、PBEREV、M05、M05-2X、M06、M06-2X、M06-L、M06-HF、M08-HX、M08-SO、M11-L、SOGGA、SOGGA11、SOGGA11-X。（M11"
" 目前不可用，但可能在不久的将来添加）。"

msgid "Additional gradient theories: CCSD, DF-MP2, DF-CASSCF, DF-RS2"
msgstr "新增梯度理论：CCSD、DF-MP2、DF-CASSCF、DF-RS2"

msgid ""
"New analytical gradient codes are now available for DF-MP2, DF-CASSCF, DF-"
"RS2 (including MS and XMS options, also without density fitting), and for "
"CCSD."
msgstr ""
"现在已为 DF-MP2、DF-CASSCF、DF-RS2（包括 MS 和 XMS 选项，也可不使用密度拟合）以及 CCSD 提供了新的解析梯度代码。"

msgid "Local methods for excited states"
msgstr "激发态的局域方法"

msgid ""
"First-order properties of excited states via time-dependent Local CC2 linear"
" response theory and ADC(2) are now also available for triplet states. This "
"is described in K. Freundorfer, D. Kats, T. Korona, and M. Schütz, *Local "
"CC2 response method for triplet states based on Laplace transform: "
"Excitation energies and first-order properties*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3506684>`__ **133**, 244110 (2010);"
msgstr ""
"现在也可通过基于时间依赖的局域 CC2 线性响应理论和 ADC(2) 获得激发态的一阶性质，包括三重态。这在 K. Freundorfer, D. "
"Kats, T. Korona, and M. Schütz, *Local CC2 response method for triplet "
"states based on Laplace transform: Excitation energies and first-order "
"properties*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3506684>`__ "
"**133**, 244110 (2010) 中有所描述；"

msgid "NMR shielding tensors at DF-LMP2 level using GIAOs"
msgstr "使用 GIAO 在 DF-LMP2 级别计算 NMR 屏蔽张量"

msgid ""
"An efficient method for calculating NMR shielding tensors at the local MP2 "
"level has been implemented. Gauge including atomic orbitals (GIAOs) are used"
" to eliminate the gauge origin dependence. Density fitting is employed to "
"factorize the relevant electron repulsion integrals and their derivatives "
"w.r. to the magnetic field. So far, the method has been already applied to "
"systems with more than 2500 contracted basis functions and 300 correlated "
"electrons. Relevant publications are S. Loibl, F. R. Manby, and M. Schütz, "
"*Density fitted, local Hartree-Fock treatment of NMR chemical shifts using "
"London atomic orbitals*, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970903580133>`__ **108**, 477 (2010), and "
"S. Loibl and M. Schütz, *NMR shielding tensors for density fitted local "
"second-order Møller-Plesset perturbation theory using gauge including atomic"
" orbitals*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4744102>`__ "
"**137**, 084107 (2012)."
msgstr ""
"已实现一种在局域 MP2 级别计算 NMR "
"屏蔽张量的高效方法。使用包含规范的原子的轨道（GIAO）来消除规范原点依赖性。采用密度拟合来分解相关的电子排斥积分及其对磁场的导数。迄今为止，该方法已应用于具有超过"
" 2500 个收缩基函数和 300 个相关电子的体系。相关出版物为 S. Loibl, F. R. Manby, and M. Schütz, "
"*Density fitted, local Hartree-Fock treatment of NMR chemical shifts using "
"London atomic orbitals*, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970903580133>`__ **108**, 477 (2010)，以及 S. "
"Loibl and M. Schütz, *NMR shielding tensors for density fitted local second-"
"order Møller-Plesset perturbation theory using gauge including atomic "
"orbitals*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4744102>`__ "
"**137**, 084107 (2012)。"

msgid "SAPT(CCSD)"
msgstr "SAPT(CCSD)"

msgid ""
"Symmetry-adapted perturbation theory of intermolecular interactions with "
"monomers described in the CCSD level."
msgstr "对称性适应微扰理论用于描述单体在 CCSD 水平的分子间相互作用。"

msgid "Improved SCF algorithms for high-spin open-shell systems"
msgstr "改进的高自旋开壳层系统 SCF 算法"

msgid ""
"For open-shell systems, RHF and RKS now use a two-step diagonalization "
"process by default: Here the beta orbitals are found by a second "
"diagonalization in the subspace of occupied alpha orbitals. This process "
"usually leads to more stable convergence in difficult cases, compared to the"
" standard diagonalization of a single open-shell Fock matrix (the latter "
"behavior is recovered by {rhf,algo=0}). An additional section with "
"suggestions for dealing with difficult cases has been added to be manual "
"under “The SCF program”. Additionally, various limitations of the SCF "
"program have been lifted. In particular, {rhf; maxit,1} now always works, "
"and just calculates a Fock matrix and energy from the input orbitals, "
"without updating said orbitals."
msgstr ""
"对于开壳层系统，RHF 和 RKS 现在默认使用两步对角化过程：这里，β 轨道通过在占据的 α "
"轨道子空间中进行第二次对角化来找到。与标准对角化单个开壳层 Fock 矩阵相比，此过程通常在困难情况下能带来更稳定的收敛（后一种行为可通过 "
"{rhf,algo=0} 恢复）。手册中“SCF 程序”部分已添加一个关于处理困难情况的建议章节。此外，SCF "
"程序的各种限制已被解除。特别是，{rhf; maxit,1} 现在始终有效，并且仅从输入轨道计算 Fock 矩阵和能量，而不更新所述轨道。"

msgid "FCIQMC: Stochastic Full CI"
msgstr "FCIQMC：随机全组态相互作用"

msgid ""
"The FCIQMC program exists through an interface to the ``NECI`` codebase, "
"which is actively developed in the group of A. Alavi, and has been "
"integrated in to the Molpro code. The FCIQMC method is a recently introduced"
" stochastic method which can calculate in principle FCI-quality energies for"
" small to medium-sized molecules. See G. H. Booth, A. J. W. Thom, and A. "
"Alavi, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3193710>`__ **131**, "
"054106 (2009); D. M. Cleland, G. H. Booth, and A. Alavi, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3525712>`__ **134**, 024112 (2011); G. H. "
"Booth, D. M. Cleland, A. J. W. Thom, and A. Alavi, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3624383>`__ **135**, 084104 (2011)."
msgstr ""
"FCIQMC 程序通过一个接口连接到 ``NECI`` 代码库，该代码库在 A. Alavi 的研究组中积极开发，并已集成到 Molpro "
"代码中。FCIQMC 方法是最近引入的一种随机方法，原则上可以计算中小型分子的全组态相互作用质量能量。参见 G. H. Booth, A. J. W. "
"Thom, 和 A. Alavi, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3193710>`__ "
"**131**, 054106 (2009); D. M. Cleland, G. H. Booth, 和 A. Alavi, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3525712>`__ **134**, 024112 (2011); G. "
"H. Booth, D. M. Cleland, A. J. W. Thom, 和 A. Alavi, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3624383>`__ **135**, 084104 (2011)。"

msgid "Ab Initio Multiple Spawning Dynamics"
msgstr "从头算多重生成动力学"

msgid ""
"The AIMS module implements the Ab Initio Multiple Spawning method to perform"
" dynamics calculations on multiple electronic states. It can also be used "
"quite generally for first principles molecular dynamics on a single "
"electronic surface, provided that nuclear gradients are available. "
"Currently, non-adiabatic dynamics is limited to CASSCF wavefunctions; "
"however, MS-CASPT2 non-adiabatic dynamics (with an implementation of "
"analytical MS-CASPT2 non-adiabatic couplings) will be provided in the very "
"near future. See M. Ben-Nun and T. J. Martinez, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0009-2614(98)01115-4>`__ **298**, 57 (1998); B."
" G. Levine, J. D. Coe, A. M. Virshup and T. J. Martinez, Chem. Phys. "
"**347**, 3 (2008); T. Mori, W. J. Glover, M. S. Schuurman and T. J. "
"Martinez, J. Phys. Chem. A **116**, 2808 (2012)."
msgstr ""
"AIMS "
"模块实现了从头算多重生成方法，用于在多个电子态上进行动力学计算。只要核梯度可用，它也可以相当普遍地用于单个电子表面的第一性原理分子动力学。目前，非绝热动力学仅限于"
" CASSCF 波函数；然而，MS-CASPT2 非绝热动力学（带有解析 MS-CASPT2 非绝热耦合的实现）将在不久的将来提供。参见 M. Ben-"
"Nun 和 T. J. Martinez, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0009-2614(98)01115-4>`__ **298**, 57 (1998); B."
" G. Levine, J. D. Coe, A. M. Virshup 和 T. J. Martinez, Chem. Phys. **347**, "
"3 (2008); T. Mori, W. J. Glover, M. S. Schuurman 和 T. J. Martinez, J. Phys. "
"Chem. A **116**, 2808 (2012)。"

msgid "Updated def2 basis sets"
msgstr "更新了 def2 基组"

msgid ""
"The partially augmented Turbomole basis sets def2-SVPD, def2-TZVPD, and "
"def2-QZVPPD (Rappoport, Furche: `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3484283>`__ **133**, 134105 (2010)) have been "
"added to the library. Additionally, the recently developed dhf- variants of "
"the def2- basis sets have been included (dhf-SVP, dhf-TZVPP, ..., Weigend, "
"Baldes: `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3495681>`__ **133**, "
"174102 (2010)); these are reoptimized versions for the more modern MDF "
"effective core potentials (most elements used MDF ECPs already in def2- and "
"are unchanged). Short names like TZVPP (without prefix) now refer to dhf- "
"basis sets."
msgstr ""
"部分增广的 Turbomole 基组 def2-SVPD、def2-TZVPD 和 def2-QZVPPD (Rappoport, Furche: "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3484283>`__ **133**, 134105 "
"(2010)) 已添加到库中。此外，最近开发的 def2- 基组的 dhf- 变体也已包含在内 (dhf-SVP, dhf-TZVPP, …, "
"Weigend, Baldes: `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3495681>`__ "
"**133**, 174102 (2010))；这些是针对更现代的 MDF 有效芯势重新优化的版本（大多数元素在 def2- 中已经使用了 MDF "
"ECP，因此保持不变）。像 TZVPP（不带前缀）这样的简称现在指的是 dhf- 基组。"

msgid "Parallel builds merged"
msgstr "并行构建已合并"

msgid ""
"The MPP and MPPX builds of Molpro have been merged and the decision to run "
"in MPP or MPPX mode made a run-time option. To build parallel Molpro the "
"``-mpp`` flag to configure should be used; the ``-mppx`` flag is no longer "
"required or valid. When running parallel Molpro, the ``--mpp`` option "
"(default) can be used to specify MPP mode, and the ``--mppx`` option for "
"MPPX mode."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 的 MPP 和 MPPX 构建已合并，并且决定在 MPP 或 MPPX 模式下运行已成为运行时选项。要构建并行 Molpro，应使用配置的"
" ``-mpp`` 标志；\\ ``-mppx`` 标志不再需要或有效。运行并行 Molpro 时，可以使用 ``--mpp`` 选项（默认）指定 "
"MPP 模式，使用 ``--mppx`` 选项指定 MPPX 模式。"

msgid "Auto-build options for parallel configuration"
msgstr "并行配置的自动构建选项"

msgid ""
"New options for configuring parallel Molpro to run on a single node or "
"workstation have been implemented. These options (see manual) are prefixed "
"with ``-auto``, and in conjunction with ``-mpp`` configure will download, "
"build and install a variety of different prerequisites for parallel Molpro."
msgstr ""
"已实现用于配置并行 Molpro 在单节点或工作站上运行的新选项。这些选项（参见手册）以 ``-auto`` 为前缀，与 ``-mpp`` "
"结合使用时，配置程序将下载、构建并安装并行 Molpro 所需的各种不同先决条件。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2010.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2010.1 的新功能"

msgid ""
"The functionality is essentially the same as in 2009.1, but many bug fixes "
"and small improvements have been added. Please note the following major "
"changes, in particular of the default RI basis sets in explicitly correlated"
" methods as described below."
msgstr ""
"功能基本上与 2009.1 版本相同，但添加了许多错误修复和小改进。请注意以下主要变化，特别是如下所述的显式相关方法中默认 RI 基组的变化。"

msgid "AIC density fitting integral program"
msgstr "AIC 密度拟合积分程序"

msgid ""
"A faster integral program for density fitting, written by Gerald Knizia, has"
" been added. In particular this speeds up the integral evaluation in F12 "
"calculations by up to a factor of about 10 (depending on the basis set). "
"This program is now used by default, but can be disabled by setting"
msgstr ""
"已添加一个由 Gerald Knizia 编写的、更快的密度拟合积分程序。这尤其将 F12 计算中的积分求值速度提高了约 10 "
"倍（取决于基组）。该程序现在是默认使用的，但可以通过设置来禁用"

msgid "``dfit,aic=0``"
msgstr "``dfit,aic=0``"

msgid "in the beginning of the input."
msgstr "在输入的开头。"

msgid "Pair specific geminal exponents in explicitly correlated methods"
msgstr "显式相关方法中针对电子对特定的双电子指数"

msgid ""
"Different exponents for the Slater-type geminals can be used for valence-"
"valence, core-valence, and core-core pairs. See manual for details."
msgstr "对于斯莱特型双电子函数，可以为价-价、核-价和核-核电子对使用不同的指数。详见手册。"

msgid "Change of defaults in explicitly correlated methods"
msgstr "显式相关方法中默认设置的更改"

msgid ""
"For explicitly correlated F12 calculations that use the VnZ-F12 orbital "
"basis sets (OBS), it is now the default to use the corresponding "
"VnZ-F12/OPTRI basis sets to construct the complementary auxiliary orbital "
"basis (CABS). In case that CABS is not used (e.g., in LMP2-F12), the OBS and"
" OPTRI sets are merged automatically. This yields exactly the same results "
"as would be obtained with the CABS approach. In order to use the default RI "
"sets of 2009.1, please specify option RI_BASIS=JKFIT on the command line, or"
msgstr ""
"对于使用 VnZ-F12 轨道基组 (OBS) 的显式相关 F12 计算，现在默认使用相应的 VnZ-F12/OPTRI 基组来构建互补辅助轨道基组 "
"(CABS)。如果未使用 CABS（例如，在 LMP2-F12 中），OBS 和 OPTRI 基组会自动合并。这将产生与使用 CABS "
"方法完全相同的结果。为了使用 2009.1 版本的默认 RI 基组，请在命令行指定选项 RI_BASIS=JKFIT，或者"

msgid "``explicit,ri_basis=jkfit``"
msgstr "``explicit,ri_basis=jkfit``"

msgid ""
"For compatibility reasons, it is still the default to use the JKFIT sets as "
"RI basis for the AVnZ orbital basis sets. In order to use the corresponding "
"OPTRI sets (where available) please specify option RI_BASIS=OPTRI."
msgstr ""
"出于兼容性考虑，对于 AVnZ 轨道基组，默认仍使用 JKFIT 集合作为 RI 基组。若要使用相应的 OPTRI 集合（在可用的情况下），请指定选项 "
"RI_BASIS=OPTRI。"

msgid "New basis sets in the Molpro library"
msgstr "Molpro 库中的新基组"

msgid ""
"A number of new basis sets have been added to the Molpro library since "
"version 2009.1. The references for these sets can be found in the headers of"
" the respective libmol files."
msgstr "自 2009.1 版本以来，Molpro 库中已添加了许多新基组。这些集合的参考文献可在相应 libmol 文件的头部找到。"

msgid ""
"**Li, Be, Na, Mg:** a) New official versions of the correlation consistent "
"basis sets for these elements have been added, both non-relativistic and "
"those contracted for Douglas-Kroll relativistic calculations. Specifically "
"these are: cc-pVnZ (n=D-5) cc-pwCVnZ (n=D-5) aug-cc-pVnZ (n=D-5) aug-cc-"
"pwCVnZ (n=D-5) and the above with a -DK extension. The older cc-pVnZ basis "
"sets for these elements can still be accessed via the keywords vdz-old, etc."
" b) New basis sets, including RI and MP2 auxiliary sets, have been added for"
" F12 explicit correlation calculations: cc-pVnZ-F12 (n=D-Q) cc-pCVnZ-F12 "
"(n=D-Q) The optimized CABS auxiliary sets have the same name but with a "
"/OptRI context For MP2 and CCSD auxiliary sets, the cc-pVnZ/MP2FIT sets of "
"Hättig can be used, but a new cc-pV5Z/MP2FIT set has been added that is "
"optimal for the new cc-pV5Z basis set; new aug-cc-pVnZ/MP2FIT (n=D-5) sets "
"have been added as well. The original cc-pV5Z/MP2FIT sets of Hättig have "
"been renamed v5z-old/mp2fit."
msgstr ""
"**Li, Be, Na, Mg:** a) 已为这些元素添加了新的官方版本相关一致基组，包括非相对论版本以及为 Douglas-Kroll "
"相对论计算收缩的版本。具体包括：cc-pVnZ (n=D-5) cc-pwCVnZ (n=D-5) aug-cc-pVnZ (n=D-5) aug-"
"cc-pwCVnZ (n=D-5) 以及上述基组带 -DK 扩展的版本。这些元素的旧版 cc-pVnZ 基组仍可通过关键字 vdz-old 等访问。b)"
" 已为 F12 显式相关计算添加了新的基组，包括 RI 和 MP2 辅助集合：cc-pVnZ-F12 (n=D-Q) cc-pCVnZ-F12 "
"(n=D-Q) 优化的 CABS 辅助集合具有相同的名称，但带有 /OptRI 上下文。对于 MP2 和 CCSD 辅助集合，可以使用 Hättig 的"
" cc-pVnZ/MP2FIT 集合，但已添加了一个新的 cc-pV5Z/MP2FIT 集合，该集合针对新的 cc-pV5Z "
"基组进行了优化；还添加了新的 aug-cc-pVnZ/MP2FIT (n=D-5) 集合。Hättig 原始的 cc-pV5Z/MP2FIT "
"集合已重命名为 v5z-old/mp2fit。"

msgid ""
"**Cu-Zn, Y-Cd, Hf-Hg:** a) While the aug-cc-pVnZ-PP (n=D-5) and cc-pwCVnZ-PP"
" (n=D-5) sets were already available, the combination aug-cc-pwCVnZ-PP was "
"not yet defined. These have now been added for these elements. b) Triple-"
"zeta DK sets have been included now for all of these elements. Unless "
"otherwise noted, these were optimized for 2nd-order DKH. In the cases of Hf-"
"Hg, sets contracted for 3rd-order DKH are also now included: cc-pVTZ-DK cc-"
"pwCVTZ-DK aug-cc-pVTZ-DK aug-cc-pwCVTZ-DK and the above with -DK replaced by"
" -DK3 for DKH3 calculations in the case of Hf-Hg."
msgstr ""
"**Cu-Zn, Y-Cd, Hf-Hg:** a) 虽然 aug-cc-pVnZ-PP (n=D-5) 和 cc-pwCVnZ-PP (n=D-5) "
"集合已经可用，但 aug-cc-pwCVnZ-PP 的组合尚未定义。现已为这些元素添加了这些集合。b) 现已为所有这些元素包含三ζ DK "
"集合。除非另有说明，这些集合是针对二阶 DKH 优化的。对于 Hf-Hg 元素，现在还包含了为三阶 DKH 收缩的集合：cc-pVTZ-DK cc-"
"pwCVTZ-DK aug-cc-pVTZ-DK aug-cc-pwCVTZ-DK 以及对于 Hf-Hg 的 DKH3 计算，将上述集合中的 -DK "
"替换为 -DK3。"

msgid ""
"**H-He, B-Ne, Al-Ar, Ga-Kr:** a) A variety of DK contracted basis sets have "
"been added for these elements: aug-cc-pVnZ-DK (n=D-5) cc-pCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) "
"cc-pwCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) aug-cc-pCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) aug-cc-pwCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) b) "
"Official cc-pCV6Z and aug-cc-pCV6Z are now also available for Al-Ar c) For "
"explicitly correlated calculations, the core-valence sets have been added: "
"cc-pCVnZ-F12 (n=D-Q) for B-Ne, Al-Ar cc-pCVnZ-F12/OptRI (n=D-Q) for B-Ne, "
"Al-Ar d) cc-pVnZ-F12/OptRI (n=D-Q) as also been added for He"
msgstr ""
"**H-He, B-Ne, Al-Ar, Ga-Kr:** a) 已为这些元素添加了多种 DK 收缩基组：aug-cc-pVnZ-DK (n=D-5) "
"cc-pCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) cc-pwCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) aug-cc-pCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) aug-cc-"
"pwCVnZ-DK (n=D-5) b) 官方 cc-pCV6Z 和 aug-cc-pCV6Z 现在也可用于 Al-Ar 元素。c) "
"对于显式相关计算，已添加了芯价基组：cc-pCVnZ-F12 (n=D-Q) 用于 B-Ne, Al-Ar cc-pCVnZ-F12/OptRI "
"(n=D-Q) 用于 B-Ne, Al-Ar d) cc-pVnZ-F12/OptRI (n=D-Q) 也已为 He 元素添加。"

msgid ""
"**Turbomole def2 basis sets:** The complete Turbomole def2 basis set family "
"has been added to the Molpro basis library (for all elements H to Rn, except"
" Lanthanides). The def2-orbital basis sets can now be accessed as SV(P), "
"SVP, TZVP, TZVPP, QZVP and QZVPP. In this nomenclature SVP, TZVPP, and QZVPP"
" correspond to valence double-zeta (VDZ), valence triple-zeta (VTZ) and "
"valence quadruple-zeta (VQZ) basis sets, respectively. Auxiliary density "
"fitting basis sets for all elements are available as well (e.g., TZVPP/JFIT,"
" TZVPP/JKFIT, TZVPP/MP2FIT) and are chosen automatically in density-fitted "
"calculations. Supposedly, the JKFIT sets are universal and also applicable "
"in combination with the AVnZ basis sets. Initial results indicate that they "
"also work well with the cc-pVnZ-PP and aug-cc-pVnZ-PP series of basis sets. "
"The orbital basis sets can also be accessed in singly and doubly augmented "
"versions (carrying A or DA prefixes, respectively, e.g., ASVP, DASVP), and "
"the auxiliary fitting sets in singly augmented versions (e.g., "
"ATZVPP/MP2FIT). The old Turbomole basis sets have been renamed; if required,"
" they can be accessed with a def1-prefix (e..g, def1-SVP, def1-TZVPP, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"**Turbomole def2 基组系列：** 完整的 Turbomole def2 基组系列已添加到 Molpro "
"基组库中（适用于除镧系元素外的所有 H 到 Rn 元素）。def2 轨道基组现在可以作为 SV(P)、SVP、TZVP、TZVPP、QZVP 和 "
"QZVPP 访问。在此命名法中，SVP、TZVPP 和 QZVPP 分别对应于价层双ζ (VDZ)、价层三ζ (VTZ) 和价层四ζ (VQZ) "
"基组。所有元素的辅助密度拟合基组也可用（例如，TZVPP/JFIT、TZVPP/JKFIT、TZVPP/MP2FIT），并在密度拟合计算中自动选择。据称，JKFIT"
" 集合是通用的，也可与 AVnZ 基组结合使用。初步结果表明，它们与 cc-pVnZ-PP 和 aug-cc-pVnZ-PP "
"系列基组也能很好地配合使用。轨道基组也可以以单增广和双增广版本访问（分别带有 A 或 DA 前缀，例如 "
"ASVP、DASVP），辅助拟合集合则以单增广版本访问（例如 ATZVPP/MP2FIT）。旧的 Turbomole 基组已被重命名；如果需要，可以使用"
" def1- 前缀访问（例如，def1-SVP、def1-TZVPP 等）。"

msgid "Improved support for MPI implementation of parallelism"
msgstr "改进了对 MPI 并行化实现的支持"

msgid ""
"The *ppidd* harness that manages interprocess communication has been "
"improved. The performance of the implementation based on pure MPI, as an "
"alternative to use of the Global Arrays toolkit, is considerably improved, "
"through the use of dedicated helper processes that service one-sided remote "
"memory accesses."
msgstr ""
"管理进程间通信的 *ppidd* 框架已得到改进。通过使用专门的服务于单边远程内存访问的辅助进程，基于纯 MPI 的实现（作为使用 Global "
"Arrays 工具包的替代方案）的性能得到了显著提升。"

msgid ""
"Change of the order of states and the defaults for computing the Davidson "
"correction in multi-state MRCI"
msgstr "更改了多态 MRCI 中态的顺序和计算 Davidson 校正的默认设置"

msgid ""
"The previous way to compute the Davidson correction in multi-state MRCI "
"could lead to non-continuous cluster corrected energies. This is now avoided"
" by ordering the MRCI eigenstates according to increasing energy (previously"
" they were ordered according to maximum overlap with the reference "
"wavefunctions). Furthermore, additional options for computing the Davidson "
"correction in multi-state calculations are added (for details see manual). "
"The old behavior can be recovered using options SWAP,ROTREF=-1."
msgstr ""
"先前计算多态 MRCI 中 Davidson 校正的方法可能导致非连续的团簇校正能量。现在通过根据能量递增的顺序排列 MRCI "
"本征态（之前是根据与参考波函数的最大重叠度排序）来避免此问题。此外，增加了用于计算多态计算中 Davidson "
"校正的额外选项（详情见手册）。可以通过使用选项 SWAP,ROTREF=-1 来恢复旧的行为。"

msgid "IPEA shift for CASPT2"
msgstr "CASPT2 的 IPEA 位移"

msgid ""
"A variant of the IPEA shift of G. Ghigo, B. O. Roos, and P.A. Malmqvist, "
"`Chem. Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ "
"**396**, 142 (2004) has been added. The implementation is not exactly "
"identical to the one in MOLCAS, since in our program the singly external "
"configurations are not (RS2) or only partially (RS2C) contracted. The shift "
"is invoked by giving option ``IPEA=``\\ *shift* on the ``RS2`` or ``RS2C`` "
"commands; the recommended value for *shift* is 0.25. For details of the "
"implementation see manual."
msgstr ""
"已添加 G. Ghigo, B. O. Roos 和 P.A. Malmqvist 在 `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ **396**, 142 (2004) "
"中提出的 IPEA 位移的一个变体。该实现与 MOLCAS "
"中的不完全相同，因为在我们的程序中，单外部组态未被收缩（RS2）或仅部分收缩（RS2C）。通过在 ``RS2`` 或 ``RS2C`` 命令上给出选项 "
"``IPEA=``\\ *shift* 来调用此位移；\\ *shift* 的推荐值为 0.25。有关实现的详细信息，请参阅手册。"

msgid "Karton-Martin extrapolation of HF energies"
msgstr "HF 能量的 Karton-Martin 外推"

msgid ""
"The two-point formula for extrapolating the HF reference energy, as proposed"
" by A. Karton and J. M. L. Martin, Theor. Chem. Acc. **115**, 330 (2006) has"
" been added: :math:`E_{\\rm HF,n}=E_{\\rm HF,CBS} +A (n+1)\\cdot \\exp(-9 "
"\\sqrt{n})`. Use ``METHOD_R=KM`` for this."
msgstr ""
"已添加 A. Karton 和 J. M. L. Martin 在 Theor. Chem. Acc. **115**, 330 (2006) "
"中提出的用于外推 HF 参考能量的两点公式：\\ :math:`E_{\\rm HF,n}=E_{\\rm HF,CBS} +A (n+1)\\cdot"
" \\exp(-9 \\sqrt{n})`\\ 。使用 ``METHOD_R=KM`` 来调用此方法。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2009.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2009.1 的新特性"

msgid "Basis set updates"
msgstr "基组更新"

msgid ""
"Correlation consistent basis sets for Li, Be, Na, and Mg have been updated "
"to their official versions as reported in Prascher et al., Theor. Chem. Acc."
" (2010). These now also include core-valence, diffuse augmented, and "
"Douglas-Kroll relativistically contracted versions. The previous sets are "
"still available but have been renamed vdz-old, vtz-old, etc."
msgstr ""
"Li、Be、Na 和 Mg 的相关一致基组已更新为 Prascher 等人（Theor. Chem. Acc., "
"2010）报道的官方版本。这些版本现在还包括芯价、弥散增强和 Douglas-Kroll 相对论收缩版本。之前的基组仍然可用，但已重命名为 vdz-"
"old、vtz-old 等。"

msgid "Explicitly correlated calculations"
msgstr "显式相关计算"

msgid ""
"Due to new findings, the default behavior of the F12 programs was changed in"
" the following points:"
msgstr "基于新的发现，F12 程序的默认行为在以下几点进行了更改："

msgid ""
"For open-shell systems the default wave function ansatz for was modified. "
"This affects RMP2-F12 and open-shell CCSD-F12 calculations. The new default "
"generally improves open-shell treatments and leads to more consistent "
"behavior. The previous behavior can be restored by ``explicit,extgen=0`` "
"(for more details see manual)."
msgstr ""
"对于开壳层体系，默认的波函数拟设已被修改。这影响了 RMP2-F12 和开壳层 CCSD-F12 "
"计算。新的默认设置通常能改进开壳层处理并带来更一致的行为。可以通过 ``explicit,extgen=0`` 恢复之前的行为（更多细节请参阅手册）。"

msgid ""
"The procedure for the construction of complementary auxiliary basis sets "
"(CABS) and the thresholds were changed. This affects all non-local F12 "
"calculations. The previous behavior can be restored by "
"``explicit,ortho_cabs=0,thrcabs=1-7,thrcabs_rel=1e-8``"
msgstr ""
"构建互补辅助基组（CABS）的流程和阈值已更改。这影响了所有非局域 F12 计算。可以通过 "
"``explicit,ortho_cabs=0,thrcabs=1-7,thrcabs_rel=1e-8`` 恢复之前的行为。"

msgid ""
"In numeric frequency calculations, the freezing of auxiliary basis sets was "
"improved. This can affect calculations where many redundant functions are "
"deleted."
msgstr "在数值频率计算中，辅助基组的冻结得到了改进。这可能会影响许多冗余函数被删除的计算。"

msgid ""
"Pair energies for the explicitly correlated methods can be printed using "
"``print,pairs`` If inner-shell orbitals are correlated, the cc, cv, and vv "
"contributions to the correlation energies are also printed."
msgstr ""
"显式相关方法的对能量可以使用 ``print,pairs`` 打印。如果内壳层轨道被关联，则关联能量的 cc、cv 和 vv 贡献也会被打印出来。"

msgid "Improvements to the Hartree-Fock program"
msgstr "对 Hartree-Fock 程序的改进"

msgid ""
"The atomic density guess in Hartree-Fock has been improved and extended. "
"Guess basis sets are now available for most atoms and for all "
"pseudopotentials. Most pseudopotentials have been linked to the appropriate "
"basis sets, so that it is sufficient to specify, e.g."
msgstr ""
"Hartree-Fock "
"中的原子密度猜测已得到改进和扩展。现在大多数原子和所有赝势都有可用的猜测基组。大多数赝势已链接到相应的基组，因此只需指定，例如，"

msgid ""
"which will select the correlation consistent triple zeta basis sets and the "
"associated (small core) pseudopotential. Similarly, it is mostly sufficient "
"to specify the basis set for other pseudopotential/basis set combinations."
msgstr "这将选择相关一致的三 zeta 基组和关联的（小核）赝势。类似地，对于其他赝势/基组组合，通常也只需指定基组即可。"

msgid "automatically finds that the wavefunction symmetry is 8."
msgstr "自动发现波函数对称性为 8。"

msgid "Changes to geometry input"
msgstr "几何结构输入的更改"

msgid ""
"Rationalisation of options for molecular geometry. It is now illegal to "
"specify symmetry and orientation options (eg x;noorient;angstrom) inside a "
"geometry block, which now contains just the geometry specification (Z-matrix"
" or XYZ). Options have to be specified using the new ORIENT and SYMMETRY "
"commands, and/or existing commands such ANGSTROM. This change will, "
"unfortunately, render many inputs incompatible with 2008.1 and earlier "
"versions of Molpro, but has been introduced to allow correct and clean "
"parsing of geometries containing, for example, yttrium atoms, which "
"previously conflicted with the Y symmetry option."
msgstr ""
"分子几何结构选项的合理化。现在在几何结构块内指定对称性和取向选项（例如 "
"x;noorient;angstrom）是非法的，该块现在仅包含几何结构规范（Z-矩阵或 XYZ）。选项必须使用新的 ORIENT 和 SYMMETRY"
" 命令，和/或现有的命令如 ANGSTROM 来指定。不幸的是，此更改将使许多输入与 Molpro 2008.1 "
"及更早版本不兼容，但引入此更改是为了允许正确和清晰地解析包含例如钇原子的几何结构，这在以前与 Y 对称性选项冲突。"

msgid ""
"Simplification of geometry input. The program now detects automatically "
"whether the geometry is specified as a Z-matrix, or using cartesian "
"coordinates, and so there is no need any more to set the geomtyp variable. "
"The standard XYZ format is still accepted for cartesian coordinates, but the"
" first two lines (number of atoms, and a comment) can be omitted if desired."
msgstr ""
"几何输入简化。程序现在能自动检测几何结构是以 Z-矩阵还是笛卡尔坐标形式指定的，因此不再需要设置 geomtyp 变量。标准 XYZ "
"格式仍可用于笛卡尔坐标，但前两行（原子数和注释）可根据需要省略。"

msgid "MPI-2 parallel implementation"
msgstr "MPI-2 并行实现"

msgid ""
"The program now can be built from the source files with the Global Arrays "
"toolkit or the MPI-2 library for parallel execution."
msgstr "程序现在可以使用 Global Arrays 工具包或 MPI-2 库从源文件构建，以实现并行执行。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2008.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2008.1 的新特性"

msgid "The new features of Molpro version 2008.1 include the following."
msgstr "Molpro 版本 2008.1 的新特性包括以下内容。"

msgid ""
"Efficient closed-shell and open-shell MP2-F12 and CCSD(T)-F12 methods which "
"dramatically improve the basis set convergence, as described in `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 (2007); "
"ibid. 127, 221106 (2007); ibid. 128, 154103 (2008)."
msgstr ""
"高效的闭壳层和开壳层 MP2-F12 及 CCSD(T)-F12 方法，可显著改善基组收敛，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2712434>`__ **126**, 164102 (2007); 同上 127, "
"221106 (2007); 同上 128, 154103 (2008) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"Natural bond order (NBO) and natural population analysis (NPA) as described "
"in `Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701628209>`__ **105**, "
"2753 (2007) and references therein."
msgstr ""
"自然键级 (NBO) 和自然布居分析 (NPA)，如 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268970701628209>`__ **105**, 2753 (2007) "
"及其参考文献中所述。"

msgid ""
"Correlation regions within a localized molecular orbital approach as "
"described in `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2884725>`__ "
"**128**, 144106 (2008)."
msgstr ""
"局域分子轨道方法中的相关区域，如 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2884725>`__ "
"**128**, 144106 (2008) 中所述。"

msgid ""
"Automated calculation of anharmonic vibrational frequencies and zero-point "
"energies using VCI methods as described in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2718951>`__ **126**, 134108 (2007) and "
"references therein."
msgstr ""
"使用 VCI 方法自动计算非谐振动频率和零点能，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2718951>`__ **126**, 134108 (2007) 及其参考文献所述。"

msgid ""
"Coupling of DFT and coupled cluster methods as described in `Phys. Chem. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/B804672G>`__ **10**, 3353 (2008) and"
" references therein."
msgstr ""
"DFT 与耦合簇方法的耦合，如 `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/B804672G>`__ **10**, 3353 (2008) 及其参考文献所述。"

msgid ""
"Support for latest operating systems and compilers, including Mac OS X."
msgstr "支持最新的操作系统和编译器，包括 Mac OS X。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2006.1"
msgstr "MOLPRO2006.1 的新特性"

msgid ""
"Features and enhancements in Molpro version 2006.1 most notably included "
"efficient density fitting methods, explicitly correlated methods, local "
"coupled cluster methods, and several new gradient programs: following:"
msgstr "Molpro 2006.1 版本中的特性和增强功能最显著地包括高效的密度拟合方法、显式相关方法、局域耦合簇方法以及几个新的梯度程序：如下："

msgid "More consistent input language and input pre-checking."
msgstr "更一致的输入语言和输入预检查。"

msgid "More flexible basis input, allowing to handle multiple basis sets"
msgstr "更灵活的基组输入，允许处理多个基组"

msgid ""
"New more efficient density functional implementation, additional density "
"functionals."
msgstr "新的更高效的密度泛函实现，增加了额外的密度泛函。"

msgid ""
"Low-order scaling local coupled cluster methods with perturbative treatment "
"of triples excitations (LCCSD(T) and variants like LQCISD(T))"
msgstr "具有三重激发微扰处理的低阶标度局域耦合簇方法（LCCSD(T) 及变体如 LQCISD(T)）"

msgid ""
"Efficient density fitting (DF) programs for Hartree-Fock (DF-HF), Density "
"functional Kohn-Sham theory (DF-KS), Second-order Møller-Plesset "
"perturbation theory (DF-MP2), as well as for all local methods (DF-LMP2, DF-"
"LMP4, DF-LQCISD(T), DF-LCCSD(T))"
msgstr ""
"高效的密度拟合（DF）程序，适用于 Hartree-Fock（DF-HF）、密度泛函 Kohn-Sham 理论（DF-KS）、二阶 Møller-"
"Plesset 微扰理论（DF-MP2），以及所有局域方法（DF-LMP2, DF-LMP4, DF-LQCISD(T), DF-LCCSD(T)）"

msgid "Analytical QCISD(T) gradients"
msgstr "解析的 QCISD(T) 梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytical MRPT2 (CASPT2) and MS-CASPT2 gradients, using state averaged "
"MCSCF reference functions"
msgstr "解析的 MRPT2（CASPT2）和 MS-CASPT2 梯度，使用态平均 MCSCF 参考函数"

msgid "Analytical DF-HF, DF-KS, DF-LMP2, and DF-SCS-LMP2 gradients"
msgstr "解析的 DF-HF、DF-KS、DF-LMP2 和 DF-SCS-LMP2 梯度"

msgid ""
"Coupling of multi-reference perturbation theory and configuration "
"interaction (CIPT2)"
msgstr "多参考微扰理论与组态相互作用的耦合（CIPT2）"

msgid "DFT-SAPT"
msgstr "DFT-SAPT"

msgid ""
"Transition moments and transition Hamiltonian between CASSCF and MRCI "
"wavefunctions with different orbitals."
msgstr "CASSCF 与 MRCI 波函数在不同轨道间的跃迁矩与跃迁哈密顿量。"

msgid "A new spin-orbit integral program for generally contracted basis sets."
msgstr "用于广义收缩基组的新自旋-轨道积分程序。"

msgid "Douglas-Kroll-Hess Hamiltonian up to arbitrary order."
msgstr "任意阶的 Douglas-Kroll-Hess 哈密顿量。"

msgid ""
"Improved procedures for geometry optimization and numerical Hessian "
"calculations, including constrained optimization."
msgstr "改进的几何优化和数值 Hessian 矩阵计算流程，包括约束优化。"

msgid ""
"An interface to the MRCC program of M. Kallay, allowing coupled-cluster "
"calculations with arbitrary excitation level."
msgstr "与 M. Kallay 的 MRCC 程序的接口，允许进行任意激发能级的耦合簇计算。"

msgid ""
"Automatic *embarrassingly parallel* computation of numerical gradients and "
"Hessians (``mppx Version``)."
msgstr "数值梯度和 Hessian 矩阵的自动\\ *易并行*\\ 计算（\\ ``mppx Version``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Additional parallel codes, e.g. DF-HF, DF-KS, DF-LCCSD(T) (partly, including"
" triples)."
msgstr "新增并行代码，例如 DF-HF、DF-KS、DF-LCCSD(T)（部分，包含三重激发）。"

msgid ""
"Additional output formats for tables ( `XHTML, "
"<http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1>`__ LaTeX, `Maple, "
"<http://www.maplesoft.com>`__ `Mathematica, <http://www.wolfram.com>`__ "
"`Matlab <http://www.mathworks.com>`__ and comma-separated variables), "
"orbitals and basis sets (XML), and an optional well-formed XML output stream"
" with important results marked up."
msgstr ""
"新增表格输出格式（\\ `XHTML, <http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1>`__ LaTeX, `Maple, "
"<http://www.maplesoft.com>`__ `Mathematica, <http://www.wolfram.com>`__ "
"`Matlab <http://www.mathworks.com>`__ 和逗号分隔变量），轨道和基组（XML）格式，以及一个可选的结构良好的 XML"
" 输出流，其中重要结果已标记。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2002.6"
msgstr "MOLPRO2002.6 的新特性"

msgid ""
"Relative to version 2002.1, there are the following changes and additions:"
msgstr "相对于版本 2002.1，有以下更改和新增内容："

msgid ""
"Support for IA-64 Linux systems (HP and NEC) and HP-UX 11.22 for IA-64 "
"(Itanium2)."
msgstr "支持 IA-64 Linux 系统（HP 和 NEC）以及用于 IA-64（Itanium2）的 HP-UX 11.22。"

msgid "Support for NEC-SX systems."
msgstr "支持 NEC-SX 系统。"

msgid "Support for IBM-power4 systems."
msgstr "支持 IBM-power4 系统。"

msgid ""
"The total charge of the molecule can be specified in a variable ``CHARGE`` "
"or on the ``WF`` card (see section `defining the wavefunction "
"<general_program_structure.html#defining-the-wavefunction>`__) ."
msgstr ""
"分子的总电荷可以在变量 ``CHARGE`` 中指定，也可以在 ``WF`` 卡片上指定（参见章节 `定义波函数 "
"<general_program_structure.html#defining-the-wavefunction>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "New features of MOLPRO2002"
msgstr "MOLPRO2002 的新特性"

msgid ""
"Relative to version 2000.1, there are the following principal changes and "
"additions:"
msgstr "相对于版本 2000.1，有以下主要变更和新增内容："

msgid ""
"QCISD gradients as described in `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/B105126C>`__ **3**, 4853 (2001) are now "
"available."
msgstr ""
"QCISD 梯度（如 `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/B105126C>`__"
" **3**, 4853 (2001) 中所述）现已可用。"

msgid ""
"Additional and more flexible options for computing numerical gradients and "
"performing geometry optimizations."
msgstr "增加了用于计算数值梯度和执行几何优化的额外且更灵活的选项。"

msgid ""
"A large number of additional density functionals have been added, together "
"with support for the automated functional implementer described in Comp. "
"Phys. Commun. **136** 310–318 (2001)."
msgstr ""
"已添加大量额外的密度泛函，并支持《Comp. Phys. Commun.》\\ **136** 310–318 (2001) 中描述的自动化泛函实现器。"

msgid "Multipole moments of arbitrary order can be computed."
msgstr "可以计算任意阶的多极矩。"

msgid ""
"Further modules have been parallelized, in particular the CCSD(T) and direct"
" LMP2 codes. The parallel running procedures have been improved. The "
"parallel version is available as an optional module."
msgstr "更多模块已实现并行化，特别是 CCSD(T) 和直接 LMP2 代码。并行运行流程已得到改进。并行版本作为可选模块提供。"

msgid "The basis set library has been extended."
msgstr "基组库已得到扩展。"

msgid ""
"Some subtle changes in the basis set input: it is not possible any more that"
" several one-line basis input cards with definitions for individual atoms "
"follow each other. Each new basis card supercedes previous ones. Either all "
"specifications must be given on *one* ``BASIS`` card, or a basis input block"
" must be used. ``BASIS,NAME`` is now entirely equivalent to ``BASIS=NAME``, "
"i.e. a global default basis set is defined and the variable ``BASIS`` is set"
" in both cases."
msgstr ""
"基组输入有一些细微变化：不再允许多个为单个原子定义的单行基组输入卡片连续出现。每个新的基组卡片都会取代之前的卡片。所有规格必须要么在 *一个* "
"``BASIS`` 卡片上给出，要么必须使用基组输入块。\\ ``BASIS,NAME`` 现在完全等同于 ``BASIS=NAME``\\ "
"，即在这两种情况下都定义了全局默认基组并设置了变量 ``BASIS``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Pseudopotential energy calculations can now be performed with up to "
":math:`i`-functions, gradients with up to :math:`h`-functions."
msgstr "赝势能量计算现在可以使用高达 :math:`i`-函数进行，梯度计算可以使用高达 :math:`h`-函数进行。"

msgid ""
"Many internal changes have been made to make Molpro more modular and stable."
" Support has been added for recent operating systems on Compaq, HP, SGI, "
"SUN, and Linux. The patching system has been improved."
msgstr ""
"已进行许多内部更改，以使 Molpro 更加模块化和稳定。已添加对 Compaq、HP、SGI、SUN 和 Linux "
"上最新操作系统的支持。补丁系统已得到改进。"

msgid "Features that were new in MOLPRO2000"
msgstr "MOLPRO2000 中的新功能"

msgid ""
"Relative to version 98.1, there are the following principal changes and "
"additions:"
msgstr "相对于版本 98.1，主要进行了以下更改和新增："

msgid ""
"There was a fundamental error in the derivation of the spin-restricted open-"
"shell coupled-cluster equations in J. Chem. Phys. 99, 5129 (1993) that is "
"also reflected in the RCCSD code in ``Molpro`` version 98.1 and earlier. "
"This error has now been corrected, and an erratum has been published in `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.480886>`__ **112**, 3106 (2000). "
"Fortunately, the numerical implications of the error were small, and it is "
"not anticipated that any computed properties will have been significantly in"
" error."
msgstr ""
"J. Chem. Phys. 99, 5129 (1993) 中关于自旋限制开壳层耦合簇方程的推导存在一个根本性错误，该错误也反映在 "
"``Molpro`` 版本 98.1 及更早版本的 RCCSD 代码中。此错误现已修正，勘误表已发表在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.480886>`__ **112**, 3106 "
"(2000)。幸运的是，该错误的数值影响很小，预计不会导致任何计算性质出现显著错误。"

msgid ""
"There was a programming error in the transformation of gradients from "
"Cartesian to internal coordinates, which in some cases resulted in slow "
"convergence of geometry optimizations. The error is now fixed."
msgstr "在梯度从笛卡尔坐标到内坐标的转换中存在一个编程错误，该错误在某些情况下导致几何优化收敛缓慢。此错误现已修复。"

msgid ""
"Vibrational frequencies formerly by default used average atomic masses, "
"rather than those of the most common isotopes, which is now the default "
"behaviour."
msgstr "振动频率以前默认使用平均原子质量，而非最常见同位素的质量，现在后者已成为默认行为。"

msgid ""
"MCSCF second derivatives (author Riccardo Tarroni) added (preliminary "
"version, only without symmetry). Frequency and geometry optimization "
"programs are modified so that they can use the analytic Hessian."
msgstr ""
"新增 MCSCF 二阶导数（作者 Riccardo Tarroni）（初步版本，仅限无对称性情况）。频率和几何优化程序已修改，以便它们可以使用解析 "
"Hessian 矩阵。"

msgid ""
"New internally contracted multi-reference second-order perturbation theory "
"code (author Paolo Celani) through command ``RS2C``, as described in P. "
"Celani and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.481132>`__ **112**, 5546 (2000)."
msgstr ""
"新增内收缩多参考二阶微扰理论代码（作者 Paolo Celani），通过命令 ``RS2C`` 调用，如 P. Celani 和 H.-J. "
"Werner 在 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.481132>`__ **112**, "
"5546 (2000) 中所述。"

msgid "EOM-CCSD for excited states (author Tatiana Korona)."
msgstr "用于激发态的 EOM-CCSD（作者 Tatiana Korona）。"

msgid ""
"QCISD dipole moments as true analytical energy derivatives (author Guntram "
"Rauhut)."
msgstr "QCISD 偶极矩作为真正的解析能量导数（作者 Guntram Rauhut）。"

msgid ""
"Reorganization and generalization of basis input. Increased basis library."
msgstr "基组输入的重组和泛化。增加了基组库。"

msgid "Counterpoise geometry optimizations."
msgstr "反式几何优化。"

msgid ""
"Improved running procedures for MPP machines. Parallel direct scf and scf "
"gradients are working. These features are only available with the MPP "
"module, which is not yet being distributed."
msgstr "改进了 MPP 机器的运行程序。并行直接自洽场和自洽场梯度计算已可运行。这些功能仅在 MPP 模块中可用，该模块目前尚未分发。"

msgid ""
"Important bugfixes for DFT grids, CCSD with paging, finite field "
"calculations without core orbitals, spin-orbit coupling."
msgstr "针对 DFT 格点、带分页的 CCSD、无芯轨道的有限场计算、自旋-轨道耦合的重要错误修复。"

msgid "Many other internal changes."
msgstr "许多其他内部更改。"

msgid "Facilities that were new in MOLPRO98"
msgstr "MOLPRO98 中的新增功能"

msgid ""
"Due to the changed structure of dump and operator records, the utility "
"program ``MATROP`` has a new input syntax. ``Molpro96`` inputs for "
"``MATROP`` do not work any more."
msgstr ""
"由于转储记录和算符记录的结构发生了变化，实用程序 ``MATROP`` 有了新的输入语法。\\ ``Molpro96`` 的 ``MATROP`` "
"输入文件不再有效。"

msgid ""
"In addition to these organizational changes, a number of new programs have "
"been added. Analytic energy gradients can now be evaluated for MP2 and DFT "
"wavefunctions, and harmonic vibrational frequencies, intensities, and "
"thermodynamic quantities can be computed automatically using finite "
"differences of analytical gradients. Geometry optimization has been further "
"improved, and new facilities for reaction path following have been added."
msgstr ""
"除了这些组织架构上的变更，还新增了许多程序。现在可以计算 MP2 和 DFT "
"波函数的解析能量梯度，并且可以使用解析梯度的有限差分自动计算谐波振动频率、强度和热力学量。几何优化功能得到进一步改进，并增加了新的反应路径跟踪功能。"

msgid ""
"An interface to the graphics program MOLDEN has been added, which allows to "
"visualize molecular structures, orbitals, electron densities, or vibrations."
msgstr "增加了与图形程序 MOLDEN 的接口，可用于可视化分子结构、轨道、电子密度或振动。"

msgid ""
"Integral-direct calculations, in which the two-electron integrals in the AO "
"basis are never stored on disk but always recomputed when needed, are now "
"available for all kinds of wavefunctions, with the exception of perturbative"
" triple excitations in MP4 and CCSD(T) calculations. This allows the use of "
"significantly larger basis sets than was possible before. The direct option "
"can be selected globally using the ``GDIRECT`` command, or for a specific "
"program using the ``DIRECT`` directive. See section *INTEGRAL DIRECT "
"METHODS* in the manual for details. Note that the ``DIRECT`` module is "
"optional and not part of the basic ``Molpro`` distribution."
msgstr ""
"直接积分计算现已可用于除MP4和CCSD(T)计算中的微扰三重激发外的所有类型波函数。在这种方法中，原子轨道基组中的双电子积分从不存储在磁盘上，而是在需要时重新计算。这使得可以使用比以前大得多的基组。可以通过\\"
" ``GDIRECT``\\ 命令全局选择直接选项，或使用\\ ``DIRECT``\\ 指令为特定程序选择。详细信息请参阅手册中的\\ "
"*INTEGRAL DIRECT METHODS*\\ 章节。请注意，\\ ``DIRECT``\\ 模块是可选的，不属于基本\\ "
"``Molpro``\\ 发行版的一部分。"

msgid ""
"*Local* electron correlation methods have been further improved. In "
"combination with the integral-direct modules, which implement efficient "
"prescreening techniques, the scaling of the computational cost with "
"molecular size is dramatically reduced, approaching now quadratic or even "
"linear scaling for MP2 and higher correlation methods. This makes possible "
"to perform correlated calculations for much larger molecules than were "
"previously feasible. However, since these methods are subject of active "
"current research and still under intense development, we decided not to "
"include them in the current ``Molpro`` release. They will be optionally "
"available in one of the next releases."
msgstr ""
"*局域*\\ "
"电子相关方法已得到进一步改进。结合实现了高效预筛选技术的直接积分模块，计算成本随分子尺寸的标度显著降低，对于MP2及更高阶相关方法，现在已接近二次甚至线性标度。这使得可以对比以前可行的大得多的分子进行相关计算。然而，由于这些方法是当前活跃的研究主题且仍在密集开发中，我们决定不将它们包含在当前的\\"
" ``Molpro``\\ 版本中。它们将在未来的某个版本中作为可选功能提供。"
